  'mt-fuji-cruise-and-hakone-ropeway-day-trip-by-bus': {
            averageRating: 4.77,
            totalReviews: 109,
            guideRating: 4.94,
            valueRating: 4.84,
            reviews: [
                { author: "James", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-08-14", text: "Ayaka was a great guide, very enthusiastic and knowledgeable. made the tour a joy to be on. unfortunately mount fuji was covered in cloud, Ayaka said mount fuji is only visible for only 20% of the year, it is just pot luck if you see it. even so the tour, the ship the black ice cream and the sense you were being shown around by a friend rather than guide made up for it." },
                { author: "Ally", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-05-30", text: "Anju was an excellent guide. She was accurate and comprehensive. She was also very pleasant. Our trip was fantastic right from the start. We saw many things including clear views of Mount Fuji. The pirate ship was also amazing. We met lots of wonderful people. The shrines were awesome. For the amount of time that was spent we saw much more than I expected. We also tried the black eggs. Hokane was an excellent town. This was a trip with my daughter, which will cherish forever. From Canada." },
                { author: "Elizabeth", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-05-28", text: "It’s a great experience, on time efficient tour guide Anju was so helpful and even gave us tips to where to go around Shinjuku where we were drop off." },
                { author: "dean", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-05-13", text: "Excellent trip, maybe shorten the stops and include a traditional meal option. Guide was fabulous" },
                { author: "Alexandra", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-04-21", text: "Our guide was Nanoko! What a knowledgeable and personable guide! My husband and I truly enjoyed every minute of our trip! Do not hesitate to book it! and if you're lucky you will have Nanoko, she'll make this trip one of your best memories ❤️" },
                { author: "Naomi", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-04-21", text: "The weather was good and we had an exciting and interesting trip. Anju our guide was knowledgeable and very helpful and kind. The whole day flowed smoothly and we had a great time." },
                { author: "Matthew", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-04-12", text: "The guide was knowledgeable and fun and trip had a lot of variety, definitely recommend!" },
                { author: "Crystal", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-04-11", text: "This was a lovely trip. We got to see Mt. Fuji as the day was clear. I enjoyed the the boat trip and being at the sulfur springs. I would highly recommend this this trip." },
                { author: "Jordan", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-04-05", text: "This was a highlight of our trip to Japan. Ayaka was just the perfect guide for the day. She was informative, energetic, clearly focused on ensuring all 30 of us had a great day out. The secret photo spot offers such a picturesque setting - even if Fuji chooses not to show, definitely book this trip as the escape to Hakone and the wonderful day under such an expert guide was a truly perfect way to spend one of our last days in Japan" },
                { author: "Maya", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-03-31", text: "Although we didn't see Mt fuji - we were close but super foggy, it was an action packed day and Ayaka is a great guide, keeping pace, making sure everyone feels comfortable and supported and is a master storyteller and it truly helps when guides display passion for what they do!! Great day, would recommend!" },
                { author: "Sebastian", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-03-05", text: "We had a very fun day visiting Hakone and taking a look at Mt. Fuji, thanks to our very kind tourguide Ayaka. She was able to tell us a lot about the history of the places we visited and Japan in general. The bus ride was also quite comfortable, thanks to the kind bus driver. Already recommended the tour to a friend who will visit Japan later this year!" },
                { author: "Emmanuel", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-03-02", text: "Our Mt. Fuji day trip was absolutely unforgettable, and a huge part of that was our incredible guide, Ayaka. From start to finish, she made the entire experience engaging, seamless, and truly special. Ayaka didn’t just guide us through the sights around Mount Fuji she brought Japan’s rich history and culture to life with her storytelling. As we traveled, she shared fascinating details about Japanese traditions, historical events, and local customs that gave so much meaning to everything we were seeing. It felt like we weren’t just visiting beautiful locations, but really understanding the hear" }
            ]
        },
