                { author: "Jasminka", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-08-26", text: "By far the most interesting guide ever. The whole way, and it's not a short way, he told us interesting things about Fuji. He asked us to sing a \"prayer\" with him to disperse the clouds and see Fuji, and the \"prayer\" was the song by Jon Bon Jovi \"Livin on a prayer\" I can only say that the prayer worked because we are among the 10% of tourists who saw it!Carter Sasaki the best guide, funny, cheerful, kind, unbeatable" },
                { author: "Frances", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-08-16", text: "Our trip with Akira Wang was such a lovely day out! It was so nice to have a change from the hustle and bustle of Tokyo. Fuji was great. We were very lucky with the weather. The high point for me was Oshino Hakkai. I wish we had more time there. Lunch was also very good with lovely service and great food. All in all a fantastic day out! Arigato gozaiimasu, Akira-Sama!" },
                { author: "Claudia", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-08-12", text: "Great trip, great guide Diana and great experience. Would highly recommend it!" },
                { author: "Ella", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-08-12", text: "I was glad to see Mount Fuji. Although it was surrounded by clouds. I had a great time." },
                { author: "M.", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-08-10", text: "My family and I had a great day. Everything went smoothly and was exactly as expected. We enjoyed all of the sights we saw that day. The schedule is packed. Our guide, Ben was super helpful and knowledgeable. He shared information with us and highlighted things we should try at each stop. He explained everything clearly. This was definitely a memorable experience." },
                { author: "Tuuli", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-08-08", text: "The starting point was easy to find and everything began on time. Taiyo is an excellent tour guide; he took care of everyone, everything and notified us to a very precise detail about our trip. He told fascinating stories about Japanese things and the local areas. It was easy to enjoy this day with his guidance. The whole day was well organised and we felt really welcome. I recommend this activity to everyone who wants a fun day around Mt. Fuji." },
                { author: "orlane", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-08-04", text: "the guide was incredibly attentive to everyone in the group, super patient, and really took the time to explain things properly. You could tell she genuinely loves what he does, and it made the whole experience so much more fun. Thank you for such a great outing, highly recommend! The mont fuji is incredible" },
                { author: "Lisa", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-07-30", text: "It was a 10/10. Incredible guide, every stop was so worth it. The given time for each stop was perfect. Definitely worth it and we were not too tired at the end because we loved it!!" },
                { author: "Ruby", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-07-27", text: "Very goood, we got lucky with a great view of Fuji. Easy to find meeting point. Transport was good. Our guide Kevin Liu was so nice funny and charismatic. Good varied locations and a good amount of time in every place." }
