            reviews: [
                { author: "Lisa", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-06-22", text: "Wonderful experience! We visited many places, and even though it rained, it was nice beacuse our driver was kind, friendly and professional." },
                { author: "Nick", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-06-12", text: "I had a great experience in Fuji . Great itinerary and a very friendly, thoughtful driver. Highly recommended! Nice nice！" },
                { author: "Yu", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-05-26", text: "It was a wonderful day. Our driver-guide was excellent and very helpful. They provided useful advice when needed. They were very friendly and professional, and an excellent driver. We would love to have them again if we did another driving tour." },
                { author: "冠霖", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-01-20", text: "Good value and a well-planned small group tour. We saw Mt. Fuji from different spots, had enough free time, and everything ran smoothly without waiting around. Would recommend." },
                { author: "Robert", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-01-16", text: "excellent locations to visit - a little different from the usual. host very friendly. I'll recommend it to friends and family when they plan their next visit!" },
                { author: "Kirstie", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 4, date: "2026-03-09", text: "Visited some great places! The first stop at the lake was breathtaking. The last stop at the swans was beautiful too. Limited places for lunch so it’s worth taking a packed lunch. Tour guide was friendly but spoke no English so we were unable to communicate with him. Other members of the group had to translate for us. We were told there would be an English speaking guide so it was disappointing that we missed out on some information. But he did try his best to accommodate." },
                { author: "Omar", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 4, date: "2026-01-13", text: "It was good but doesn't include to go inside of the mountain. The tour includes a few stops in different cities but the time was too short to explore and buy something." },
                { author: "Traveller", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-06-23", text: "The view from Mount Fuji was absolutely stunning. The trip was also quite comfortable, with minimal disturbances. I love traveling in small groups like this." },
                { author: "ZOU", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-06-01", text: "とても楽しい旅行でした！ドライバーさんのサービスが親切で、景色も最高でした。素晴らしい体験をありがとうございました。おすすめです！" },
                { author: "Dayne", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 1, date: "2026-05-10", text: "I wonder if the others made it to the trip, or if they also lost their money. Our trip was rescheduled to be 40 minutes earlier from 8:00am to 7:20am, and we were only notified at 9:35pm the night before, while we were asleep, so we missed out on the trip. Buyers beware" },
                { author: "Varun", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 1, date: "2026-05-06", text: "We requested english tour but the whole trip was conversed in chinese. We need our money back" },
                { author: "Helene", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 2, date: "2026-04-12", text: "Les arrêts étaient peu intéressants, souvent à des combinis, avec trop de temps pour ce qu’il y avait à faire ou alors, à la pagode, pas assez de temps pour atteindre la pagode! Exactement le même circuit que les gros bus, aucune différence ni originalité des endroits fréquentés. Beaucoup de transport pour peut-être une heure et demie de satisfaction. Le guide, très gentil, parlait très peu anglais et n’a fait que conduire. Nous n’avons pas pu voir les 3 lacs comme annoncé par manque de temps." }
            ]
