                { author: "Tatiana", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-09-14", text: "We came from Miami Tati & Nacho for my wife’s birthday and the tour lady treated us amazing She spoke perfect English and Spanish We highly recommend this tour Take cash for your last stop to have lunch Beers and sake were amazing." },
                { author: "Luísa", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-09-11", text: "Amazing day trip to Kamakura and Enoshima! Beautiful places, well organized, and our guide was amazing. Definitely worth it!" },
                { author: "Kayla", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-09-11", text: "The trip was great! Very well organized with just enough time at each stop. Appreciate the recommendations and knowledge of our guide along the way. I also really appreciated the bus, which had lots of leg room (amazing since my husband is very tall) and they even had chargers on the bus to charge your phone. Would recommend to others❤️" },
                { author: "Pablo", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-09-11", text: "Everything was perfectly organized. The guide and the bus driver were very nice. One suggestion: Give more time to explore Komachi street since it has incredible shops but time is limited to only 2 hours to visit sanctuary and street." },
                { author: "Ross", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-08-08", text: "Nice tour. Interesting sights and a knowledgeable tour guide. Had a fair amount of time to venture out and do our own things at the place we stopped and visited. I recommend it." },
                { author: "Christos", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-08-03", text: "Kamakura shrine was a very picturesque temple, Komachi street was an interesting shoping street , Hassedera was an exciting experience with a lot of things to see, big Buda statue was really big and impressive, Enoshima island was just a wonderful island especially the candle tower offered nice views of the Pacific Ocean. Our tour guide was very informative and helpful and the best of this tour was that we had plenty free time in each stop. Overall a trip which is necessary for someone who visit Tokyo to join." },
                { author: "Nanis", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-07-29", text: "⭐⭐⭐⭐⭐ Absolutely Exceptional – The Best Tour Experience We’ve Ever Had! We cannot recommend our tour guide and bus driver highly enough! From the very first moment until the end of the trip, everything was perfectly organized and executed with absolute professionalism. Every detail was planned with care, allowing us to relax and enjoy every single moment of the journey. Our tour guide was simply amazing—warm, welcoming, incredibly knowledgeable, and genuinely passionate about making sure everyone had a wonderful experience. They went above and beyond to help every guest, answered every questio" },
                { author: "Natalie", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-07-08", text: "Probably our best tour experience so far!! We visited 4 destinations and have plenty of times to explore each destination. The guides were so nice and helpful. Highly recommend!!" },
                { author: "Marco", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-06-10", text: "It was an amazing day tour away from Bustling city of Tokyo. Pan - tour guide, very knowledgeable about the area and the Japanese culture. It’s worth it." },
                { author: "Sylvia", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-05-27", text: "Great tour covers many areas and temples, tour guides are great and full of information. Highly recommend to anyone looking for a tour outside of Tokyo" }
