                { author: "Hannah", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-04-11", text: "Great trip, long journey but worth it. Guide and driver were very friendly" },
                { author: "Catherine", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-04-04", text: "Excellent trip. Well organised and instructions were clear. A delicious lunch. Saw heaps of gorgeous snow monkeys." },
                { author: "Robyn", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-03-31", text: "A very long day but to spend time with the monkeys was wonderful." },
                { author: "Sylvie", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-03-28", text: "Our guide Mr. Yamaguchi was incredible! Extremely nice and polite, explained everything well and made this trip very enjoyable. Snow monkey park is great one- day trip, you can enjoy the sceneries of Nagano prefecture and watch a bunch of playful and cute monkeys. Apple pie served at the Enzo Cafe, which is part of the park was a great cherry on top." },
                { author: "Chrissie", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-03-22", text: "Guide and driver excellent, very helpful and friendly. Enjoyed the lunch experience. Saw lots of Snow Monkeys, bathing in the hot springs and feeding. Would definitely recommend 🌟🌟🌟🌟🌟🌟" },
                { author: "Eve", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-03-21", text: "So many monkeys up close and personal. Rocked off a bucket list items, thanks!" },
                { author: "Tam", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-03-19", text: "It was AMAZING - the hike, the monkeys, and our tour guide, Ichiro Yamaguchi, made the experience very memorable! Highly recommended!" },
                { author: "Patricia", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-03-17", text: "Saw lots of monkeys. As it was fairly warm & sunny none were actually bathing in hot pool. Enjoyed the lunch" },
                { author: "gennine", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-03-15", text: "The tour was very organized and easy to follow. We had a great time seeing the monkeys at Snow Monkey Park. We wanted to specially call out how amazing our guide was, Ichiro Yamaguchi, for going above and beyond during to help us out. There was a traffic accident on our way back from Jigokudani, which would have made us late for a separate dinner reservation. We asked for his help, and he was more than willing to call the restaurant to explain our situation. He handled it for us, and made sure we were taken care of. Thank you Ichiro!" },
                { author: "Michele", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-03-14", text: "Although it was long 4 hours to the snow monkey park the traditional lunch was excellent and the experience of seeing these beautiful animals so close and so carefree were well worth the journey." }
