  'studio-ghibli-origins-walking-tour-in-tokyo': {
            averageRating: 4.83,
            totalReviews: 98,
            guideRating: 4.9,
            valueRating: 4.59,
            reviews: [
                { author: "Carol", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-09-12", text: "Our tour was wonderful! Rui took us to interesting places around Tokyo and was really knowledgeable about Studio Ghibli facts and trivia." },
                { author: "Hien", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-09-12", text: "My 10-year-old son and I had a great tour with Rui. He is a very friendly, kind, and knowledgeable guide and certainly a passionate Studio Ghibli fan. We got to go through some lovely parts of Tokyo we wouldn't have known about on our own, learned a lot about the history of how Studio Ghibli started, and saw some wonderful places and architecture that inspired some Ghibli movies. Learning about these was very inspiring for us. Rui’s tour was so well prepared and organized, with lovely surprises sprinkled through. I strongly recommend his tour. Thank you so much, Rui, for a wonderful Ghibli exp" },
                { author: "Antonio", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-09-12", text: "Rui is the best guide ever, he was showing us around real life places that are also in ghibli movies, the nice thing was that he also included scenes from other anime's like jujutsu kaisen. He was buying food and taxis for us also giving us multiple presents along the way. He always made sure we were feeling fine and was super careful about us. Great guide equals great experience, thank you Rui from me and my grandma!" },
                { author: "Samantha", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-09-11", text: "Rui was extremely well informed and was mutually as curious as he was insightful. Inquiring about American culture and our worldview, and how it is either similar or different to Japanese culture in a very considerate way. Also elaborating on the history of Japan and how it was conveyed in the Ghibli films. We even got to see Miyazaki’s brother who owns the pastry shop! It was a wonderful time!" },
                { author: "Daniel", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-08-22", text: "The tour was amazing ! It was very interesting to here about the origins of Studio Ghibli . The tour guide was brilliant ." },
                { author: "Grace", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-08-18", text: "Wonderful experience which I would highly recommend. The tour guide was lovely and very informative and it is great value for money." },
                { author: "Erwan", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-08-18", text: "Great tour with Rui-san! Very nice experience, with interesting explanations about Studio Ghibli and some of its movies. I definitely recommend it, especially if you’re lucky enough to see Miyazaki-sensei!" },
                { author: "Emmi", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-08-15", text: "Rui was our tour guide, he was very friendly and nice, we enjoyed the tour very much. We recommend 😁" },
                { author: "Matteo", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-08-13", text: "Great tour, very informative and the guide was great!" },
                { author: "Thierry", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-08-11", text: "Our guide Rui was very interesting, pleasant and knows very well the Ghibli studio history. we thank him a lot for all his explanations. it was a very nice experience for me, my wife and my son fifteen years old. we recommend this activity and we recommend this guide." },
                { author: "Fredrik", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-08-09", text: "Thanks to this tour we got the opportunity to get a glimpse of the actual locations for the Ghibli Studio history which was inspiring. Our excellent, generous and engaging guide Rui took us to several places, and most amazing was visiting the Open-Air Architectural Museum and seeing the very places that Hayao Miyazaki drew inspiration from for Spirited Away. Through this tour and thanks to Rui, we got a feel for the reality behind the animated world, and we would absolutely recommend this tour." },
                { author: "Aubrey", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-08-08", text: "Rui was knowledgeable, flexible, and accommodating. Great experience and tour of Studio Ghibli inspiration!" }
            ]
        },
