                { author: "Traveller", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-03-30", text: "What a fantastic and well-structured tour! The schedule was perfectly timed from start to finish. The fresh seafood breakfast was a highlight, and wandering through Tsukiji Market was so lively and fun. The guide took great care of the group, making the whole experience enjoyable and stress-free." }
