                { author: "Traveller", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 4, date: "2026-08-01", text: "Great intro to Tokyo - easy to find from Tokyo Station, we just used our own maps but could have used earphones for English version if we needed! Open top so did get hot, but when moving and with hats+ suncream it was a good way of visiting areas too far away to walk!" },
                { author: "Traveller", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 4, date: "2026-07-14", text: "leuke korte tour met veel highlights. de bus ziet er heel verzorgd uit en het is professioneel geregeld. de niet-japanse gids gaat via het scannen van een qr code op je eigen telefoon. En je moet zelf een koptelefoon meenemen." },
                { author: "Traveller", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-06-26", text: "普段観られない所から見る観光地はとってもいいと思いました。" },
                { author: "Traveller", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 2, date: "2026-06-18", text: "the tour completed without understanding the historic landmarks. the tour guide said a lot during the tour. but all content is 100% in Japanese which i have no idea what she was talking about. the audio from smartphone provided via a website is very limited. just 2-3 sentences on each landmark. anyway. we just had some good views along the road. but not understanding the details." }
