                { author: "Trevosha", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-04-07", text: "My experience was nothing short of exceptional. The level of attention to detail truly surpassed anything I came across online. From the moment I arrived, I was warmly welcomed by Momo and Mika, the sisters who own the studio. Their hospitality immediately put me at ease—they go above and beyond to make you feel comfortable, valued, and genuinely cared for. The entire process—from makeup and hairstyling to being dressed in a stunning kimono—felt like a deeply immersive cultural experience. Every step was thoughtfully guided, ensuring you feel confident and capture the perfect shots throughout" },
                { author: "graham", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-04-05", text: "I booked this activity for my GF and it proved to be highly enjoyable for all concerned. Two sisters prepared her with makeup, hair and costume, one of whom was the photographer. They were obviously well practiced and the lighting, props and setting was perfect, delivering more than 30 photos instantly. I was sitting watching and at the end they invited me to put on a robe and join in for a couple of bonus shots. Their enthusiasm was infectious, plus service and end product brilliant, exceeding expectations." }
