                { author: "Carlos", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-08-15", text: "Great experience. If you come to Tokyo it is a must. Sanjulian, our driver helped us to enjoy it and take the vest pictures and videos. sanjulian" },
                { author: "Julian", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-08-07", text: "Unforgettable experience in Tokyo. We did all stops as in the description and made insane fotos and videos of the cars. Daikoku PA was great too and now I‘ve really become a JDM fan" },
                { author: "Peter", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-08-06", text: "So much love for the JDM scene at Diakoku! Not only are all the cars badass, but Sanjula was a great guide in our GTR. We had 2 great nights in a row with Fernando and his crew. If you can fit a Thursday night tour in your schedule, don’t hesitate. They have me wanting to move to Japan! 10/10. We’ve been 3 nights in a row 😂" },
                { author: "Mark", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-07-31", text: "We enjoyed every minute. This company is nice. Everything and management is really nice .Driver is Very friendly, good driving and of course the experience is the best. Driving to and from Daikoku was an experience of its own. I really recommend this tour/ experience. You can choose the pick up spot from a very large area so you can start your experience directly from the hotel or Airbnb, which is not the standart in other tours. 100/1000" },
                { author: "Julija", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-07-31", text: "Our family of four had an absolutely unforgettable evening on this JDM tour! Our driver, Sanjula, was fantastic from start to finish. He picked us up in an amazing Nissan Skyline, was punctual, friendly, and incredibly knowledgeable, and made sure we had the best possible experience throughout the night. Daikoku Parking Area was everything we had hoped for and more. The atmosphere was electric, and seeing so many incredible JDM cars in one place was a dream come true for us. Thank you so much, Sanjula, for an amazing evening and for making our Tokyo trip even more special. We highly recommend" }
