                { author: "Hannah", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-09-04", text: "Tommy was absolutely amazing ! I had a fantastic time. Having never done a photo shoot before I was very nervous, but Tommy made sure I knew what to do and brought great suggestions for locations and poses. He was very knowledgeable of the area as well ! Thank you Tommy. Highly recommend for anyone visiting Shinjuku" },
                { author: "Ian", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-08-11", text: "Tommy arrived early and was totally ready to shoot. He took all of my artistic input and amplified it. Despite the rain he powered through and showed me some of the best spots in Shinjuku. He had a plan and plenty of equipment he went above and beyond and delivered an amazing product on time. I would recommend Tommy to anyone looking to capture the moment in Japan." },
                { author: "Laura", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-08-07", text: "Tommy was fantastic. We did a couples photoshoot, and he was very good with us. The quality of the shots are fantastic, and he has some great spots that are a very short distance from each other so there isn’t a lot of walking involved. Highly recommend for a solo or couples shoot." },
                { author: "Miguel", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-08-06", text: "The activity was awesome and an experience I would never forget!!! Tour guide knew the place really well, and he took incredible pictures in the most amazing and underrated spots in shinjuku!!!" },
                { author: "Stevenson", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-08-03", text: "Our activity was awesome. Tommy took some amazing pictures for us and couldn’t be more satisfied. Highly recommend 🙌🏾" },
                { author: "Anna", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-07-23", text: "Tommy was an excellent photographer and very knowledgeable about where to take the best shots in Shinjuku. I don’t do photoshoots often and felt very comfortable with him. He gave good advice on how to pose and took excellent shots. He was also a very kind and fun person to talk to. I had a lot of fun and can highly recommend to book this experience!" },
                { author: "Mariela", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-07-15", text: "I had an amazing experience with Tommy and can highly recommend this photoshoot! He was incredibly friendly, professional, and made me feel comfortable from the very beginning. It felt like more than just a photoshoot, he also showed me beautiful hidden spots around Shinjuku, shared interesting facts about Tokyo, and gave me great local recommendations. At the end, he even surprised me with a handmade photo frame featuring some of the pictures he had taken. It was such a thoughtful keepsake and showed how much care and effort he puts into his work. This was the perfect way to end my trip to To" },
                { author: "Noyra", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-07-14", text: "Tommy was the absolute best! He went above and beyond, taking the most incredible pictures. He truly has a natural talent for capturing the perfect shot. :) I HIGHLY RECOMMEND him! Beyond the amazing photos and the awesome Shinjuku tour, he is a very sweet person and gave me fantastic recommendations for local food spots. I received 5 printed and 20 digital high-quality images much faster than expected! 10/10—I will definitely book with him again!" }
