                { author: "Denis", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-09-13", text: "Great staff and very interesting story about Macha. Kimonos choices were great too. Thank you to all the staff for this wonderful moment." },
                { author: "bill", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-09-11", text: "We thought it was great value for money and certainly is a must do ,and the associated Samurai experiences was a must do as well" },
                { author: "Rachael", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-09-11", text: "Koume delivered an exceptionally detailed, friendly, and engaging tea ceremony, treating every guest with equal respect and warmth. She quickly established a wonderful rapport with everyone, creating an atmosphere that was both calming and educational. Koume’s extensive knowledge of matcha tea gave me a newfound appreciation and respect for its history, preparation, and traditions. Dressing in traditional attire made the experience even more special, allowing us to fully immerse ourselves in this beautiful cultural experience. A truly memorable experience that I would highly recommend." },
                { author: "Tracy", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-09-10", text: "It was absolutely fantastic from start to finish. It was very well organised and everybody was so friendly. The only negative was we did not know in advance that we could stay in the kimono till 6 pm. If we knew that we would of planned our day around that and enjoyed spending the day dressed up." },
                { author: "Lucia", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-09-09", text: "Amazing experience! Everything was perfect and well done. My boyfriend and I chose this acrivity to know more about Japanese culture and it was satisfactory! Many thanks to the all staff, each of us was super kind and nice!" },
                { author: "Katie", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-09-08", text: "Such an amazing experience. The guides were so friendly and explained the experience completely. Definitely recommend." },
                { author: "Samantha", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-09-04", text: "Very good experience. I enjoyed it very much. I highly recommend visiting." },
                { author: "Talita", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-09-02", text: "Everything was perfect, top 10 best experiences in Tokyo o recommend it for 100%, they are kind and explain everything in perfection… I loved to learn how to make matcha. Kind regards to all the team ❤️❤️❤️" },
                { author: "Skye", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-08-26", text: "The tea ceremony was AMAZING!!! I learned history, drank matcha, and learned some Japanese. It was very meditative and zen. The match was delicious. They made me feel beautiful in my traditional kimono." },
                { author: "Bernerdette", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-08-25", text: "Would definitely recommend this experience!! So professional and made me feel so beautiful!! You have the kimono until 6pm so the earlier you book the more pictures you can get! Matcha experience was wonderful. Great location in central Shinjuku and next to a shrine!!" },
                { author: "Aishah", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-08-24", text: "My partner and I had a really wonderful time here. The tea ceremony was informative, we got to walk around the shrines and take pictures in our kimonos. The staff were so friendly and helpful (I couldn’t choose there was a wide selection). Highly recommend as a must do activity if you’re ever in Tokyo" }
