                { author: "Michele", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-08-27", text: "Tono is the perfect representation for your culture and business. We thoroughly enjoyed our time with the kimono dressing and tea ceremony. Loved that we were allowed to wear the kimonos for a period of time to take other photos as we walked around the area. Thank you!" },
                { author: "Sabrina", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-08-27", text: "Absolutely perfect! Everyone was so nice to me and the instructions and explications were very clear. I loved it and definitely recommend it!" },
                { author: "Ruth", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-08-26", text: "My mother’s and I had a lovely experience!! The hosts were knowledgeable, kind, and funny. This was unique, a value add, and very enjoyable. We had so much fun! I highly recommend you add this to your Tokyo itinerary." },
                { author: "Palesa", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-08-26", text: "Eye opening and educational experience that we thoroughly enjoy and savoured! It was beautiful to partake in the tea ceremony and to learn the significance thereof!! Everyone from reception to the ladies who clothed us to the tea ceremony conductor were amazing, to say the least!! Excellent experience. Thank you Asakusa branch❤️" },
                { author: "Lauren", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-08-21", text: "A lovely experience and a great way to start our holiday!" },
                { author: "Ali", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-08-21", text: "This was a full on tea ceremony with kimono! Our host was very nice to all of us and took her time to explain everything. Adults and kids enjoyed this activity a lot." },
                { author: "Vivi", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-08-17", text: "I was simply enthralled. The tea master was so kind and clear, she answered any questions and she was incredibly charismatic. The tea ceremony itself felt comforting and calm, something I greatly enjoy. It actually made me even more interested in Tea Ceremony. She even shared some history. They dress you properly in a kimono and take many pictures of you as well, a plus." },
                { author: "Francesco", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-08-17", text: "An absolute joy to be part off! Everyone was accommodating and helpful sharing their kindness and culture. Thank you would highly recommend!" },
                { author: "Gemma", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-08-15", text: "A Once in a life time experience. The tea hostess was great. Highly Recommend." }
