                { author: "David", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-09-11", text: "We had a great time with a really fun and interactive crew! And the sushi was easy enough to make with the instructions and the taste was great as well! We highly enjoyed and recommend!" },
                { author: "Sravana", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-09-08", text: "Great experience! Everyone was so kind, funny and helpful!" },
                { author: "Garine", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-09-08", text: "nice and small group, had a fun time learning about the history of sushi, then making it and eating it. I liked that we learnt to make two types , maki and nigiri which are the two main things we love to eat! the ladies were great teachers and assistants. The beer was perfectly cold beer (you can purchase as a separate cost). My son and I had a great time." },
                { author: "Daniel", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-09-08", text: "Amazing tutorial, and fantastic quality food. Was a good challenge, ended up being a bit more complex than I thought but the guides did a great job of educating. Very friendly overall. The fish was absolutely incredible and so tasty!" },
                { author: "Andrea", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-09-08", text: "This was such a fun experience, the crew was awesome and so friendly. Suchi was so yummy! I would definitely recommend you going if you visit japan! I love this!!!" },
                { author: "Razvan", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-09-06", text: "The experience was really fun and interactive! Oy oy oy!" },
                { author: "Patricia", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-09-04", text: "This sushi-making class was honestly one of the highlights of our trip to Japan! The whole experience was absolutely amazing from beginning to end. The instructions were incredibly clear and easy to follow, even if you have never made sushi before. What made it really special, though, was how kind, patient and welcoming everyone was. They took the time to explain every step, helped us whenever we needed it, and made the whole experience so much fun and relaxed. We learned so much, laughed a lot, and of course got to enjoy the sushi we made at the end! It felt like much more than just a cooking" },
                { author: "Jesper", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-08-24", text: "Great experience through and through. From having a really nice and knowledgeable instructor guiding us though the whole process, to tasting the finished result, the whole experience felt really rewarding!" },
                { author: "Abishek", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-08-18", text: "Great class! Was so fun learning about the history of sushi and we made so many delicious sushi. Satomi was a great host!" },
                { author: "Rakan", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-08-16", text: "Excellent activity to do while in Tokyo very informative, hands on, fun and yummy." }
