            reviews: [
                { author: "Julie", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-08-08", text: "Rino was an excellent guide and companion the entire evening. She was very knowledgeable about the food and the area where we walked. She was also very personable and a joy to engage with. Rino speaks very good english and my family and I highly recommend her!" },
                { author: "Marcy", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-07-25", text: "Naori was a great guide. Great mix of restaurants and arcade to keep everyone happy and engaged" },
                { author: "Leigh", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-07-24", text: "Amazing tour! Shuhei was a brilliant guide, reliable, personable, knowledgeable and fun to spend an evening with. Our eating experiences were second to none and it was a real highlight of our time in Tokyo. His English was perfect and gave us lots of good tips and information about the city. He made our two teenage boys feel included and we could not rate him highly enough! 5 stars ++++" },
                { author: "Angela", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-07-20", text: "Fantastic! Our guide made sure to make changes to one of our restaurants to accommodate the fact that I had had surgery and was unable to sit on the floor in the traditional Japanese manner. She was friendly and kind and fun. ❤️" },
                { author: "Maria", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-07-17", text: "Naoki was fantastic! I’m so glad we booked this tour because we would have never found these hidden gems on our own. I knew we wanted to experience Shinjuku, but since it was just me and my 16-year-old son, I also wanted something family-friendly. Having a fun, knowledgeable local guide took all the stress out of navigating the trains and figuring out where to eat. Instead of ending up in tourist traps, we got to enjoy an authentic evening exploring places we never would have discovered ourselves. All three food stops were unique, delicious, and memorable. Naoki also made sure we saw some of S" },
                { author: "Corynna", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-07-14", text: "Yu was great! She was patient, kind and took us to amazing places! We were very pleased and had a lot of fun! I highly recommend her!" },
                { author: "Paul", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-07-04", text: "Really awesome night and tailored to our kids thank you" },
                { author: "Stephanie", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-06-27", text: "Shinjuku is a very busy area with so many hidden restaurants and bars we decided to have a guide to help us navigate the area with our teen. Our guide Akira was very familiar with the area and brought us to some truly unique places and experiences that we would have never found on our own. Our teen especially loved the tour and mentioned that it felt more like we were hanging out with a friend than the other formal tours we had been on." },
                { author: "Jay", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-06-16", text: "Our night food tour in Shinjuku with Zenji was easily one of the absolute highlights of our trip! From start to finish, Zenji was incredibly friendly, kind, and welcoming. He has a wonderful energy and was especially fantastic with our daughter, making sure she felt included and engaged the entire time. The food and stops were spectacular. We had multiple food stops with perfect okonomiyaki that truly felt like a place reserved only for locals we never would have discovered on our own. Incredible, fresh nigiri and visiting the coolest hidden gem of a snack bar with amazing drinks. Kind enough" },
                { author: "Laura", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-06-06", text: "We truly enjoyed the food, the experience, the in-between moments, and the company of our guide, Yui. She was friendly and kind and a wonderful dinner companion. We would never have discovered a couple of the areas she showed us, including our last stop on the tour. It was the perfect way to kick off our trip and we gained knowledge and confidence for dining out during the rest of our trip! Thank you to Yui! P.S. Skip lunch!" },
                { author: "Rachel", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-06-04", text: "Naoki was truly amazing! He made it so fun and we enjoyed all the restaurants and walking around Shinjuku. What a great tour and highlight of our trip." },
                { author: "Tessa", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-05-20", text: "My teenagers loved this! It was one of the most favorite things we did in Japan. A great family activity." }
            ]
