                { author: "Tanya", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-08-31", text: "Kenny and Mizu were fabulous. Very informative, picked great stalls and gave good options post tour. 5 stars!" },
                { author: "Isabell", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-08-29", text: "Our guide Kawa was amazing. He told a lot of interesting stories about the market and gave a lot of very good food suggestions. We had a very very good time! Thank you!" },
                { author: "Timothy", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-08-28", text: "If you get George as your guide, you’re in for a big treat. George speaks excellent English and packs his commentary full of fun facts. He guides you to the some of the most quirky and unusual stalls - difficult to find if you try to do this tour on your own. Highlights for me were sizing up a king size crab leg, enjoying delicious Japanese omelette together and winding up for coffee at the John Lennon bar. Apparently ever since he and Yoko drank there in 1978, they’ve been playing Beatles songs there! 5 stars for an unmissable tour - not just for foodies! Assad’s George!" }
