                { author: "Derek", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-08-08", text: "Lena was a knowledgeable tour guide with a passion for Japanese history. The tour was paced well and ended on a high note in a gorgeous Japanese garden. I would recommend for anyone staying in central Tokyo near the Imperial Palace." },
                { author: "Stefano", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-08-04", text: "Very good, interesting, well thought and well explained" },
                { author: "Alessia", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-06-16", text: "Thomas and Sophie were excellent guides providing a vast range of knowledge (cultural, historical, nature and pop) along the whole way. Also really engaging, fun and positive people. I couldn't recommend enough :)" },
                { author: "Sophie", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-06-01", text: "Such an amazing tour! Our guide was extremely knowledgeable and it was so interesting to hear their fun facts alongside their explanations of the history of the Imperial Palace. So glad to of enjoyed the beautiful gardens whilst also walking away with so much knowledge from this tour! I 100% recommend it 😊" },
                { author: "David", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 4, date: "2026-08-26", text: "it was a rocky start when the original tour guide did not show up but when another guide from the company came she made it a nice informative afternoon." },
                { author: "Angela", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-08-16", text: "Una visita stupenda, Len la nostra guida e’ stata molto brava a spiegarci la storia di come tutto è stato creato e come si è evoluto negli anni, una bellissima esperienza. Grazie Lena spero che i tuoi sogni si realizzino." },
                { author: "Traveller", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-06-19", text: "Our guide was so lovely, he had such great stories about the gardens and castle and was just over all knowledgeable (he knew ball). Would def recommend!" },
                { author: "Traveller", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-06-16", text: "The Imperial Palace gardens were so beautiful, and I had so much fun learning about the different stories and history of the shogun, emperor, and samurai! Our guide Thomas was absolutely amazing!! The group isn’t too big so I could ask lots of questions. I saw other tour groups but no one was as animated or having as much fun as our guide was! He truly is passionate about Japanese history, and I got to learn so much from this. This is absolutely something you must do while in Tokyo, a highlight of my trip." },
                { author: "Traveller", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-06-03", text: "As someone who rarely goes on guided tours: I highly recommend this one!! The guide was very knowledgeable and friendly. I liked the links between Edo period Japan to modern day Japan. Not only did I learn historical facts, the walk itself was very nice and ends in the beautiful east gardens. Book this one if you're in Tokyo! 😊" }
