                { author: "Friedrich", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-05-22", text: "Wir hatten das Glück als kleine Gruppe zu sechs Teilnehmern in einem Kleinbus zu reisen. Unsere Begleitung, Frau Mai, hat uns so viel Wissenswertes vermittelt und uns auch mit sehr viel Engagement die Zeit während der Fahrt unterhaltsam gestaltet. Vielen herzlichen Dank liebe Mai!" },
                { author: "Traveller", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-05-20", text: "It was a fantastic trip. Our guide, Yoshio, was very fluent in English and entertainingly explained a lot about Nikko, as well as various topics about Japanese culture, history, and even modern times, and gave us tips in how to enjoy Tokyo. Furthermore, everything was excellently organized; there was plenty of time for each excursion, and he made sure no one got lost or was left behind. We also had a female bus driver who navigated the Irohazaka Slope route with ease and skill. I can highly recommend this trip" },
                { author: "dino", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-05-19", text: "Il viaggio comodissimo, l'autista molto bravo. La guida è stata bravissima sempre presente ad aiutarci ci ha guidato e accompagnati sempre." },
                { author: "Breault", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 4, date: "2026-05-06", text: "Belle excursion, le seul regret , en anglais, on aurait apprécié le français" },
                { author: "Traveller", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 4, date: "2026-04-15", text: "Mia, our guide was perfect" },
                { author: "Traveller", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-04-14", text: "It was a great day, our guide was very friendly and knowledgeable. We were a small group and the whole trip never felt rushed. Minor feedback, the bus seats were a bit narrow and no charging outlets on the bus" }
