                { author: "Massimiliano", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-08-22", text: "The view from Shibuya Sky was truly beautiful, and the guide was very kind to us; they recommended the best spots and took many wonderful photos of us. Finally, accompanied by the guide, we took a walk along both the main street and a small, charming lane lined with historic bars." },
                { author: "Patrick", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-08-20", text: "My partner and I both did this tour tonight with Shige. The tour was fantastic and Shige spent a great amount of time with both showing us around shibuya and the famous Shibuya sky. Shige took wonderful photos for both of us throughout the night and was incredibly insightful about the surroundings of Shibuya! A big thanks must go to Shige as well for helping us order great food and drinks at the end of the tour. With this being our last night on our long trip, we were delighted to end on such a high. I genuinely cannot thank Shige enough for making our last night in Japan so incredible!" },
                { author: "Ramon", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-08-14", text: "Showed us several great spots in shibuya with fascinating history of shibuya" },
                { author: "Traveller", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-09-17", text: "Excelente guía es la Sra Johana muy bien informada, amable y con excelente atención, gracias Johana!" },
                { author: "Traveller", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-09-13", text: "Tour was outstanding and our guide was amazing and attentive." },
                { author: "Laura", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 1, date: "2026-09-12", text: "Tour was a WASTE OF TIME & MONEY. They either purposely changed the itinerary or weren’t aware of what it actually was. We didn’t start at the “dog statue”, didn’t do Shibuya Crossing, we went straight to the Sky tower & they were upset that we expected to do the other activities first like said on THEIR itinerary because they bought 7:20 tickets for a 7:15 tour start (we were supposed to the outside first). Then just presented our tickets to enter and we didn’t see them again. No stories, no pointing out land markers and the “GRAND FINALE” was they wanted to take us to the POKÉMON center-some" }
