  'daikoku-pa-lbwk-gtr35-700hp-ginza-a-pit-daikoku-tokyo-tower-by-local-operator': {
            averageRating: 5.0,
            totalReviews: 39,
            guideRating: 5.0,
            valueRating: 4.96,
            reviews: [
                { author: "Konrad", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-09-16", text: "It was really great to achieve one of my long time dreams. The driver had really good skills, Me and my wife felt comfortable during the ride. Everything meet our expectations, I would recommend it." },
                { author: "Paul", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-09-04", text: "Absolutely amazing experience! Our driver, Fernando, the main man himself made the whole experience even better. He was incredibly friendly, welcoming, and genuinely passionate about making sure everyone had a great time. He made sure we all got a turn in the front seat and was more than happy to accommodate our little requests, which really made the experience feel personal and special. The whole experience was unforgettable, and I’d say it’s a must-do while you’re in Tokyo. If you’re a GT-R enthusiast like me, this is an absolute no-brainer. Seeing and experiencing these cars up close while" },
                { author: "Philipp", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-08-14", text: "Our tour with Fernando was perfect! He knew exactly when the peak time at Daikoku was on that day and made sure we arrive there in time. We got to see so many great cars at Daikoku and on the way back, just like we hoped for. Fernando was a very kind and knowledgeful host and his widebody GTR35 is one of the coolest cars around, highly recommend! Thank you so much and see you next time for the late night tour ✌️" },
                { author: "Bhavya", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-08-12", text: "Wonderful experience!! Manidha was a great host and made the evening fabulous with this beautiful R35 Crazyy car loved it" },
                { author: "Aycan", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-08-09", text: "It was a wonderful experience; don’t miss out on the Daikoku experience in the most beautiful car you’ll find in Tokyo" },
                { author: "Peter", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-08-05", text: "Fernando is awesome, his cars are incredible, A-pit alone was worth it, but Daikoku was even better. This GTR is insane! This is a must book activity if you love fast cool cars. 10/10. We’re doing it again tomorrow!" },
                { author: "Matthew", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-06-22", text: "My son (15) and I just got back from our tour with Fernando and we had the best time. If you love cars and want the real experience of Tokyo car culture at Daikoku this is the best way to do it. Such a kind and fun host would recommend this to anyone!" },
                { author: "Jim", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-06-14", text: "Sanjula met us on time at our hotel in an epic GTR. The evening absolutely exceeded our expectations and if anyone wants a first hand experience with what car culture looks like in Japan I’d highly recommend this tour. My sons and I picked Saturday night. We drive the highway, the tunnels, the rainbow bridge and to the parking lot with all the awesome cars . The turnout was amazing. The highway ride home was our favourite with a pit stop for pic s under the Tokyo Tower. Thanks Sanjula! Cheers, Jim, Seth and Sam Pakeman" },
                { author: "Jay", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-05-16", text: "Highly recommended! Thank you for the amazing tour! From the beautiful scenery to the great tour guide and the team. Made our trip worth while! See you next time." },
                { author: "Jasmin", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-05-05", text: "We did the Tokyo Modified GTR35 Widebody Daikoku Private Tour with Fernando and his team, and it was absolutely incredible from start to finish. Driving across the Rainbow Bridge at night was surreal, and stopping at Daikoku was a dream come true—such an iconic spot with an amazing atmosphere. One of the highlights was getting stunning photos in front of Tokyo Tower, which made the whole experience feel even more special. The cars were beautiful, the ride was smooth and exciting, and everything was very well organized. Fernando and his team are very trusted and professional drivers who made us" },
                { author: "Jürgen", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-03-28", text: "Today, we had our GTR35 tour with @Sanjula. It was truly an extraordinary experience. Great driver & guide, great car, and the stop at the right car spots. We were pleasantly surprised and felt very well taken care of. The ride will stay in our memory for a long time. It couldn’t have been better." },
                { author: "Julian", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-03-15", text: "Great experience in an amazing car, with even more crazy cars at the Yokohama’s hotspot. I highly recommend the tour with Fernando 👌🏼" }
            ]
        },
