                { author: "Adrien", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-01-25", text: "My family and I absolutely loved our grand sumo experience with Tatsie! She was very knowledgeable about the sport and answered all of our questions. She was early at the meeting spot and we loved the small group size. She helped show us where to park our stroller, making it very easy of an experience to travel with our infant too! We would most certainly book another experience with Tatsie again!! Thank you for an unforgettable experience of a lifetime!!" }
