  'manga-drawing-workshop-guided-by-pro-manga-artist-in-tokyo': {
            averageRating: 4.93,
            totalReviews: 144,
            guideRating: 4.96,
            valueRating: 4.83,
            reviews: [
                { author: "Philippa", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-08-04", text: "This one of the best things we have done. Both me and my son loved every second and have a wonderful piece of art as a reminder. The artists were so nice and wanted us to create an amazing piece. We have learned lots of skills. You don’t need any art skill really to do this." },
                { author: "Tanya", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-07-30", text: "Amazing authentic experience with a professional artist who patiently guided our 3 tween/teenage kids through manga. They created really awesome drawings and thoroughly enjoyed themselves." },
                { author: "Claire", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-07-20", text: "We had a great mother / daughter experience with the artist and the interpret. The workshop is available for any level of drawing as the artist helps with the sketch. She also adapts to the character you want to draw, and the final drawing turned into a beautiful souvenir." },
                { author: "Isabelle", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-07-19", text: "My son and I loved the activity. He likes to draw Manga characters on his computer so this was really an amazing experience for him. The artist teaching and the assistant translating were so nice and helpful. I would recommend to anyone who enjoy art even if you are not used to draw." },
                { author: "Andreas", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-07-07", text: "The Manga Drawing Workshop was one of our highlights in Tokyo. It was amazing how all our attempts to somehow draw a manga (never done before!) totally worked out fine - all 3 kids + 2 grown ups now have a beautifully self-crafted manga as a souvenir, thanks so much!! Recommendation!!" },
                { author: "Claire", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-07-01", text: "We did the manga drawing experience workshop on Monday 29/6. It lasted for around 2hrs. You picked what you wanted to draw before hand. You could choose a character, your pet, family member etc. The artist would make an outline of your chosen design and you would adjust and go over and shade it in from there on. Help was always there when needed. Both me and my son really enjoyed the experience and took home a personal piece of artwork. Would 100% recommend if your a big manga fan and even not like me who also had just as much fun." },
                { author: "saurav", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-06-08", text: "Our two girls participated in the activity and we are reviewing based on their experience which was fantastic. They were guided along in a fun way and had a blast. This is a must do for kids who are into anime and manga. My girls even ended up going to stationary in Shinjuku to buy a lot of art supplies !!" },
                { author: "Christina", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-06-04", text: "My daughter and I had so much fun! She has some drawing experience and I came in as a complete beginner and we both left with a great piece of work that we loved. A great souvenir from our vacation in Tokyo! Timing was a bit tight to learn all of the techniques, but we were happy with our finished products. Many thanks to the artist and translator!" },
                { author: "Brandon", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-06-03", text: "It was an amazing experience for my boys and I. My boys love anime and manga art and I enjoyed learning with them! Thank you so much for a wonderful time!" },
                { author: "Courteney", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-06-01", text: "I booked this for my husbands birthday present and we had the most amazing time. Fuyu Sensei and Machi were so lovely and helpful. We had the best afternoon, Fuyu Sensei is so talented and helped us soo much with our drawings - we now have the most incredible pieces of art to remember our time in Tokyo. Machi was so lovely to chat to and gave us great recommendations for Shibuya (Machi - we avoided the crossing!😂) and Okinawa. Brilliant afternoon and really good value for money - thank you both so much!!" },
                { author: "Edward", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-05-29", text: "since our group was 5... they split us with 2 different teachers and interpreters ...I'm not an artist only one in our family can really draw.. but the experience was so much fun and the results afterwards ere great.... it's a must do." },
                { author: "Jackie", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-05-25", text: "It was our group of three only so it felt like a private lesson. The artist sketched out our designs and we were able to personalize and add details to them. We were able to learn more about creating and publishing manga. We left with real art we created and had fun doing it." }
            ]
        },
