                { author: "Laura", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-08-12", text: "I really loved the Asakusa Tokyo Sushi Making Class: Matcha nad Unlimited Sake! The staff was amazing and created a great, relaxed atmosphere. They explained everything step by step in a very simple way, so it was super easy to follow. I highly recommend this workshop to everyone!" }
