  'authentic-kintsugi-and-matcha-experience-in-shibuya-tokyo-by-local-operator': {
            averageRating: 5.0,
            totalReviews: 29,
            guideRating: 5.0,
            valueRating: 5.0,
            reviews: [
                { author: "Kate", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-07-18", text: "My teenage daughter and I so enjoyed our Kintsugi experience! It was wonderful to repair our own ceramics using this traditional Japanese technique. Michiko was an excellent teacher and helped us create beautiful plates to take home. Thank you!" },
                { author: "Maya", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-07-16", text: "This is an authentic kintsugi experience, and we loved it! The guide is a real kintsugi teacher, which is a craft that takes decades to learn. As a half Japanese woman who grew up in Tokyo, I wanted to take my friends to an authentic experience, and was skeptical of the cheap workshops that were being advertised for an hour or so on various sites. I chose this one because the teacher is a real master, and I wanted to learn the right techniques so I could do it at home. She combines the lesson with snacks and learning about the history of kintsugi, which honors the spirit of the practice. It wa" },
                { author: "Ian", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-06-18", text: "Brilliant brilliant brilliant! Michiko-san provided a wonderful experience - from the matcha, to the barley tea, to the snacks...and that was just the warm up. The Kintsugi workshop was excellent and every step was explained to us. Michiko-san is a wonderful teacher and we ended up with some nice looking plates. Would recommended to everyone, fantastic!" },
                { author: "Heidi", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-06-08", text: "My daughter and I had so much fun at this workshop. It was very intersting and we got to take home a very special souvenir. I also purchased a kit to take home to repair some sentimental pieces I have. We loved ths experience! Our hosts were amazing!!" },
                { author: "Rebecca", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-05-24", text: "This class was one of the highlights of our trip! Every detail was thought out, with wonderful mathcha and sweets, expert instruction, and beautiful pottery and even a amazing box to keep it in. Amazing hosts and felt personal and was an aurhentic experience." },
                { author: "Mary", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-05-24", text: "Best experience of the trip! Such a personable experience as well as informative and rewarding." },
                { author: "Sharon", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-05-08", text: "Was intrigued by this workshop based on other reviews and suggested it to my travel buddy who was less than enthusiastic at first. We had a great time, totally enjoyed ourselves, and created a wonderful keepsake memento from our trip. I'm so happy we took the time to locate the meeting place and followed through with a great adventure. Treats were tasty and they kept our tea cups fillled! Highly recommend this event!" },
                { author: "Rachel", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-04-14", text: "Amazing workshop for my teenage daughter and me. Expert tuition with great teacher-to-student ratio. Loved it and will treasure my little kitsugi plate forever!" },
                { author: "Justine", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-04-03", text: "The guides skilfully led us through the steps to create a piece of kintsugi. They were very hospitals, the venue is wonderful and cosy and the drinks and Japanese sweets plentiful. would highly recommend this activity: relaxing and learning a new skill." },
                { author: "Christina", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-03-13", text: "Michiko-San provided a wonderful experience making modern kintsugi in a warm and inviting atmosphere. We appreciated the learning about the history of the craft, enjoying tea and snacks, and even meeting her cute dog, Bob! Michiko-San was patient, kind, and hospitable. This was such a unique way to create a memory of our trip to Tokyo. We look forward to returning and doing another workshop in the future." },
                { author: "Florian", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-02-17", text: "We joined a beautifully curated two-hour modern kintsugi workshop at mon cadeau and created our own small keepsake while learning the philosophy behind this traditional art. The process was explained clearly and patiently, making it easy to follow and deeply meaningful. Michiko and Yuki were exceptional hosts — warm, attentive, and genuinely passionate. They created such a welcoming, almost family-like atmosphere that we felt comfortable from the very first moment. Their kindness and thoughtful guidance made the experience truly special. This workshop was one of the highlights of our time in T" },
                { author: "Naomi", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-01-26", text: "This experience was a great way to participate in a modern version of Kintsugi. It was fun and relaxed and Michiko was a great teacher and hostess. Highly recommend." }
            ]
        },
