                { author: "Maggie", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-05-15", text: "This experience was probably one of the most memorable experiences for my husband and I during our 2-week trip in Japan. Sachiyo is an excellent guide. She’s very knowledgeable and adaptive to our desire to have best sushi and wagyu during the tour. We also appreciated knowing about the lottery to get to the lower deck for better viewing of the Tuna Auction. Highly recommended." },
                { author: "Cynthia", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-05-12", text: "Our tour guide and the tour was excellent. YukaG was knowledgeable, personable, and friendly. She met us at our hotel and maximum our time at the fish markets. She took us to places that we wouldn’t have found on our own and made good recommendations along the way. The trip to the fish auction was a highlight of our trip. We were lucky to have won the market lottery which allowed us to be closer and see more of the fish, auction, and logistics of the market. YukaG helped us get to the right place seamlessly. Thank you thank you for such a memorable morning." }
