  'ikebana-workshop-in-tokyo-japanese-flower-art-experience-by-local-operator': {
            averageRating: 4.96,
            totalReviews: 29,
            guideRating: 5.0,
            valueRating: 4.62,
            reviews: [
                { author: "Brent", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-08-21", text: "Had a great time Demi! He’s so informative, friendly and crazy talented! Clear direction complete with a comprehensive overview via slide show. Outstanding work" },
                { author: "Anita", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-07-25", text: "We were truly overwhelmed by how much we learned during this course. Ikebana is a beautiful art form that enriches life, and we will definitely continue practicing it when we return home. Everything was explained so clearly, with great passion and enthusiasm. The instructor created a wonderful atmosphere and made this traditional Japanese art both accessible and inspiring. Thank you for this unforgettable experience!" },
                { author: "Steven", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-05-19", text: "Demi is a very good teacher. He is patient and knowledgeable. I hope that more students take his class. Good activity to have, especially with an elderly person." },
                { author: "Claudia", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-05-12", text: "We got a good sense of what ikebana is, and we were able to try out the first level for ourselves with lots of helpful tips. It was really interesting and a lot of fun!" },
                { author: "Joanna", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-05-06", text: "Amazing!I had such a great time at this workshop and enjoyed every single minute of it. I would fully recommend it to anyone thinking about joining. Demi is incredibly welcoming and a fantastic teacher, he created a really relaxed, easy-going atmosphere that made the whole experience even better. Don’t hesitate, just go for it!" },
                { author: "Georgina", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-04-19", text: "Demi was so interesting and skilled at explaining and teaching Ikebana history, techniques and philosophy - a perfect creative experience in a tranquil space. Thank you!" },
                { author: "Andrea", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-04-13", text: "Thank you so much for this experience , what we learned was intresting and beautiful. Thank you . Andrea" },
                { author: "Sharon", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-03-31", text: "A fabulous first experience with Ikebana. The patient and enthusiastic teacher is an artist whose sculptural work informs his award winning modern free style. He had me create a basic Ikebana, step-by-step, explaining the rules of proportion and placement clearly. The result was both dramatic and harmonious. His English, while not yet fully fluent, was easy to understand and fully up to the demands of the lesson and discussion of underlying principles." },
                { author: "Jan-Niclas", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-03-25", text: "Demi has a very pleasant way of teaching not only the fundamentals of the craft but also the history and different styles of Ikebana. With Guidance and free flow phases you will be able to create your first own beautiful Ikebana. Was such an amazing experience thank you so much. 🙏" },
                { author: "Gail", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-03-16", text: "We had a great time! Our instructor gave us an excellent understanding of Ikebana and guided us every step of the way. He was encouraging and helped us create something unique and special. I highly recommend this activity." },
                { author: "Maria", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-03-07", text: "The instructor, Demi, shared the principles of ikebana and guided me in creating a basic composition. He is a skilled practitioner and a great teacher. It was amazing to see the composition look a million times better after a simple adjustment he made. I also got to see an advanced student at work, which further expanded my horizons in understanding the framework and the beauty of this ancient art. A textbook in English is also available to purchase; don’t hesitate to buy it. Thank you very much for a great experience." },
                { author: "Aleid", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-02-14", text: "This was such an amazing experience. Demi is an artist thru and thru…he is knowledgeable, kind and patient. He creates a nice atmosphere and explain the philosophy as well as the practicality of Ikebana. I got to do my own arrangement and that was such an exhilarating experience. I totally recommend Demi and this studio. Thank you so much 🩵" }
            ]
        },
