  'become-an-anime-voice-actor-pro-studio-dubbing-in-tokyo': {
            averageRating: 5.0,
            totalReviews: 6,
            guideRating: 5.0,
            valueRating: 5.0,
            reviews: [
                { author: "Vittorio", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-09-11", text: "This was one of the most fun, unique things we did on our trip to Tokyo. The folks at the recording studio were fun and charismatic, and also the real deal. We got to very goofily act out way through a sort of infomercial anime, very kawaii. A few days later we got the full edited clip, which was so cool! My only criticism is that I wish the guides had given us a little more instruction- we were kind of told to act however we wanted, but I was hoping to be *taught* how to voice act a little more. Some direction, please! Still, a very memorable experience that I would recommend to anyone." },
                { author: "Samuel", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-09-05", text: "Amazing and unique experience in Shinjuku. All of the staff was super friendly and welcoming. 2 professional voice actors spent the full session with us, coaching us, giving us tips… Dubbing the clip was a lot of fun (you can do many voices). The team also answered all of our questions, and offered some insights on their work as voice actors. I definitely recommend!" },
                { author: "Baylee", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-09-05", text: "10/10 experience! Meeting professional voice actors, watching them work, and then having to recreate that was so difficult! I am able to respect more what they do! Also watching anime now will be different because I’ll think about all the work and dedication that is put into making everything finalized! The voice actors I met, whether they’re the main character or not of a game, show, and so on— was so special because it’s crazy to see how close connections are in Japan!" },
                { author: "Traveller", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-08-30", text: "Amazing experience! Everyone was so friendly and welcoming! Being a voice actor from the UK, it is very different and a lot more fun! 😊" },
                { author: "Traveller", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-08-11", text: "Incroyable, nous avons beaucoup aimé. Toutes les personnes présentes nous ont bien accueillis. Une des meilleures activités qu'on ait faites durant de notre séjour au Japon ! Superbe expérience !!" }
            ]
        },
