            reviews: [
                { author: "Sardar", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-09-16", text: "The experience is a must to do when you are in Osaka. Our guide Yan Lei was very interactive and knowledgeable about each location. He also made sure to show us how to travel the complete path. He also made sure to write and translate the complete guide for the tour which made the experience even more worth it. The trip ended with a foot onsen and snacks provided by Yan and while overseeing the mountains. 10/10 activity and guide" },
                { author: "Claudia", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-09-14", text: "We had a great time visiting the main shrines and temples of the Kumano Kodo. Hanazawa was agreat tour guide/driver. It‘s a long day, but well worth it." },
                { author: "Rocco", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-09-14", text: "This tour was great from start to finish. Everything was well organised, smooth, and stress-free. Our guide was punctual, incredibly friendly, and efficient. The itinerary was perfectly paced, giving us plenty of time to take in all the highlights without ever feeling rushed." },
                { author: "Przemysław", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-09-14", text: "It's more like a taxi service from Osaka to all the shrines rather than a guided tour. The driver didn't speak English. When we arrived to the places, we were given small maps to understand where to go and the time limit. In the bus there were short recordings played explaining the shrines we are about to visit. To be honest, I like this approach, it let us see the places with our pace and with no need to stick with the group. Time limits were quite tight, there was no time to leisure, but otherwise we wouldn't make it in one day. Overall, we enjoyed the entire experience. The driver said he's" },
                { author: "Bastián", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-09-12", text: "Hanasawa-san was a great driver, the tour lets you go \"at your pace\" and in between spots it explains you the history of Kumano Kodo, highly recommend if you like to go more \"in your own way\"." },
                { author: "Thomas", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-09-11", text: "Amazing trip. Please be ready to hike before booking this tour. There are a lot of stairs!! but the experience was great!" },
                { author: "Bjorn", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-09-11", text: "Everything was ok. The guide, although not speaking English, was very helpful and kind. Everything was translated by AI and information was very good. Tour Is wonderful with great things to see, even when it is raining." },
                { author: "Tessa", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-09-09", text: "Our guide was fantastic. He was informative and made sure directions were clear. We loved taking this trip and would recommend it to anyone interested in visiting these shrines in a short amount of time." },
                { author: "John-Paul", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-09-06", text: "It was a very long trip, so this tour is very comfortable with no hassle to drive. The temples are very nice. Taian was also very gentle. The trip ends with a well needed foot bath in hot mineral water. Great Trip!" },
                { author: "Jared", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-09-02", text: "It was awesome Yan was awesome! Definitely worth the price, very good atmosphere, nice nature walks beautiful temples and even while driving great views" },
                { author: "jonathan", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-08-31", text: "This was a beautiful experience where we were caught so much about these beautiful temples, and surely got to see the beauty of Japan’s countryside. It was all worth it. You’re in Osaka go ahead and give yourself a chance to experience this wonderful tour" },
                { author: "Helen", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-08-28", text: "A long drive and a big day but worth it for what you experience. Kuduo had a Herculean task driving us around all day and did a great job." }
            ]
