                { author: "Maylis", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-08-03", text: "Great tour which gave us a completely different view on Japan's culture. Fantastic guide, super interesting, we also had dinner in a small restaurant with karaoke and the group ended up all singing together :-) Super fun evening!" },
                { author: "Sara", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-07-23", text: "Knox was a great guide! Very informative and respectful of the areas we visited. Definitely saw and heard about the side of not only Osaka but Japanese culture I wouldn’t have got on any other tour." },
                { author: "Jaroslav", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-07-14", text: "The whole tour was great, our guide was super interesting layed back person. It is a shame that some of the buildings shown are being torn down, but that is life." },
                { author: "Alex", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-07-11", text: "This tour is awesome! Definitely suited for an older audience but one of the best tours I did on my visit to Japan. My husband and I appreciated all the information Brian shared with us, and we had such a fun and inclusive group. I would totally recommend this tour!" },
                { author: "Ayana", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-07-06", text: "I’ve been many weeks in Japan and this is by far one of the best tours I’ve been on! Taka is very kind and knowledgeable about Osaka and Japan. He gives time for additional conversation and questions and seemed to have an answer for everything we asked. I’ve been on many walking tours but this tour managed to teach me many new things about the cultural of Osaka and Japan. At the end, everyone in my group gave Taka the same praise, he made the tour feel like we were just a group of old friends hanging out, making jokes, sharing stories, and having a drink. Make sure to have dinner at the end so" }
