                { author: "Meya", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-09-02", text: "Mikey was our tour guide & he did amazing. Seeing Himeji castle was a surreal experience, as I have the Lego & looked forward to seeing it, the lunch was delicious as well. 10/10 experience" },
                { author: "Paola", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-08-13", text: "Gary is an incredible guide: he took care of us from the moment we met him until we stepped out of the bus - providing us with an amazing lunch and making sure every aspect of the tour was comfortable. The Himeji Castle is absolutely worth a visit in his own right, but Gary did a brilliant job and showcased a level of historical and artistic knowledge rare even among tour guides. The tour was amazing and enjoyable both for the beatiful sights and for Gary's great professionalism." },
                { author: "M.", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-08-04", text: "Everything ran smoothly from pickup to drop off. Our guide Gary was very organized and helpful. He gave us a lot of information and history. There was enough time at each stop to enjoy the sights." },
                { author: "James", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-07-24", text: "We recently joined a wonderful day tour to see Himeji Castle and really enjoyed the experience. Our guide, Garry, was outstanding—professional, incredibly knowledgeable about the history, geology, and cultural significance of the area, and genuinely enthusiastic throughout the day. He kept the group engaged with great stories and tips, made sure everyone had perfect photo opportunities (the views were stunning on a clear day!), and handled all the logistics smoothly." },
                { author: "Vanessa", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-07-17", text: "The tour was great, and Himeji Castle is absolutely beautiful. Arima Onsen town was amazing too, and we enjoyed a wonderful onsen there. Our tour guide Nick was fun and had lots of stories to share about Osaka and the attractions we visited. He paid great attention to everyone on the bus. We traveled with a baby stroller for our son and our 10-year-old daughter, and thanks to Nick’s help and the bus driver’s help, everything went smoothly." },
                { author: "Steve", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-07-16", text: "it was good. Just weather sucked but not the tour guides fault." },
                { author: "Stephen", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-07-15", text: "What an incredible tour. Our guide Nick san was amazing. He went above and beyond to ensure everyone was comfortable and happy. He definitly made the day. Very funny and knowledgable. The day was jam packed but went at a good pace. Highly recommend this tour and especially Nick. t" },
                { author: "Svetlana", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-06-26", text: "We really enjoyed this tour! 10,5 hours went by very fast! Our tour guide Nick was great! He was funny, had many stories about Japan, Osaka, places we visited. The whole bus was laughing at his jokes and comments. He paid attention to every customer, making sure everyone is happy and enjoying the tour. Himeji castle is so beautiful! This tour gives you enough time to enjoy the castle and gardens! Arima Onsen was very relaxing! Very cute old Japanese streets to shop, take pictures and eat if you don’t want onsen. And Mt. Rokko is breathtaking! You can see Kyoto and Kobe at the same time! So man" },
                { author: "Caroline", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-06-18", text: "Very relaxing trip. I especially appreciate the guide Harry who gives us detailed information about the places we visited. He made the places come to life with his stories on the history. I value the guide very much. He was attentive to all guests. Of the 5 tours I took so far, Harry is the best guide. Clean bus, comfortable ride, great guide, this trip is a great value. Highly recommend!" },
                { author: "Emily", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-06-08", text: "We absolutely loved the trip - it was a perfect day and Gary was a great tour guide." },
                { author: "Yvonne", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-06-04", text: "Our guide Veggie gave us lots of info about the history and culture of Japan, and the sites we visited. Himeji Castle is beautiful and it was nice to take a break in Anima. Thanks also for all the suggestions for busy/eating after the trip." },
                { author: "Helen", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-06-02", text: "Liked everything. Very good tour with enough time at each location." }
