                { author: "Kyle", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2019-04-28", text: "My tour guide took me on a journey as if it were a right of passage to the people of Osaka. I loved every moment of it." },
                { author: "Santiago", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2018-11-23", text: "Brice was excellent and very efficient with time. We walked around Osaka and hit many tourists spots but also took shortcuts and saw places “off the beaten path” I recommend this to anyone specially on a short stay in Osaka." },
                { author: "Michael", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2018-06-09", text: "Airi was a great guide. We were allowed to see the most beautiful side of Kyoto, with realy beautiful hidden temples and shrines off the tourist routes. And all that without hurry. Definitely recommended!" },
                { author: "Lee", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 4, date: "2023-06-27", text: "We connected with our guide just before the tour but our guide was able to adjust our itinerary to hit the highlights and pass on some we wanted to see ourselves." },
                { author: "Traveller", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 4, date: "2025-04-26", text: "The guide was very nice and kind. however we did not visit the historical parts so I would suggest to ask to the guide in advance if this is what you would like to do in osaka. if not the market could be also done without a guide in my opinion." },
                { author: "David", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2025-03-09", text: "Boris was excellent. Very knowledgeable." },
                { author: "Claudia", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2024-08-18", text: "Tour bellissimo di Osaka. La nostra guida, Maria è stata molto paziente e ci ha lasciato tutto il tempo di fare foto senza metterci fretta. È stata davvero molto amorevole con oi assicurandosi che non soffrissimo il caldo durante tutta la giornata. Osaka è bellissima e Maria ci ha raccontato un sacco di usanze e tradizioni tipiche. Lo consigliamo a tutti." },
                { author: "Traveller", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2024-06-19", text: "Although the group was a little tired after extended walks in Tokyo, Antoine was easy-going, flexible and fun in introducing us to several interesting neighborhoods in Osaka. He also sent personalized recommendations after." }
