                { author: "Jan", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-08-27", text: "It was very well organized from the beginning til the end. Also our guide Angeles was excellent, very helpful and gave us a lot of insights and useful information about places we visited. The only one negative thing from my point of view was the fact that admission fee for the museum of Hiroshima A-bomb victims wasn’t included into the whole price. As for me it was very small amount and on the other hand every participant should be involved into acknowledging with this very sad mankind history." },
                { author: "Varuni", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-08-26", text: "Wonderful Tour We had a wonderful day exploring Miyajima Island and Hiroshima with Angeles.She was so kind, friendly, and knowledgeable, and made the whole experience special and enjoyable. Thank you, Angeles, for the beautiful memories! Highly recommended! Arigato gozaimasu" },
                { author: "Donna", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-07-29", text: "Angeles was my guide for the tour. what can I say, what a great day I had. Angeles was so passionate about the Island of Miyajima, she gave us the history, the culture and some interesting information about the Island. Her recommendations were spot on. Then we went to Hiroshima, Wow! That was so amazing, I didn't think that I would get that emotional. Again Angeles was passionate about the history of this place. Her information was spectacular. I have come away from a very poignant area with more knowledge, more understanding and more empathy, that was because of Angeles, Thank you 😊 Also grea" },
                { author: "Sonia", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-07-29", text: "It was great I loved it! Angeles was amazing and very open to helping everyone . She made this trip awesome by explaining things very well. I would book her again" },
                { author: "Susan", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-07-26", text: "The trip was wonderful. Caesar is an excellent and patient guide, translating both into Spanish and English. Both Miyajima and Hiroshima were amazing and touched my heart. Also thumbs up to our driver Ito who kept the bus cool on a very very warm day." },
                { author: "Maryann", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-07-24", text: "I enjoyed spending time in Miyajima and the Hiroshima Peace museum. I think it was a perfect amount of time dedicated to each part of trip." }
