                { author: "Nancy", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-01-23", text: "We had the very best time with Kenta! Kenta is an excellent guide and made seeing Kyoto a pleasure! We never would have seen what we did without a hassle! Kenta shared so much with us...his knowledge is vast ! I would definitely recommend having Kenta guide you in Kyoto !!!!!" },
                { author: "Lesley", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2025-12-27", text: "We had an absolutely wonderful day in Kyoto thanks to our fantastic tour guide, Wajid. He guided us expertly through Fushimi Inari Shrine, sharing fascinating insights as we walked through the iconic torii gates. At Sanjusangendo Temple, his explanation of the 1,001 Buddha statues added real depth to the experience. Our visit to Kiyomizu-dera, a UNESCO World Heritage site, was perfectly paced and richly informative. Wandering through Sannenzaka and Ninenzaka, Wajid pointed out cultural details, photo spots, and hidden gems. We finished at Maruyama Park, learning about geisha culture and even s" },
                { author: "Russell", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2025-11-21", text: "It was a great all day tour with an excellent guide Flavio. Include both popular spots and local treasures often not seen. A walk along a quiet river, history, sake tour and tasting, temples, shrines, and even pizza made for a wonderful day. We ended with a bowl of ramen highly recommended by a Flavio’s wife!" },
                { author: "Neeraj", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2025-11-20", text: "Maria our tour guide was knowledgable about this history of the temples in kyoto. Having lived in japan for over 25 years and as a licensed tour guide she was informative about culture economics and history" },
                { author: "Aina", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2025-11-04", text: "Yuji is a wonderful guide! He takes you everywhere efficiently and knows so much about the history and the best ways to move around Hiroshima and its surroundings. We learned a lot and had such a great time with him. 11/10✨" },
                { author: "Erin", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2025-09-02", text: "Kev did a great job on our tour today! He showed us some less popular spots, taking into account the heat. He also sent us recommendations for food afterwards and dropped us off at an udon restaurant he recommended at the end of the tour!" },
                { author: "Frederic", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2025-08-26", text: "Good discovery of Gion Kyoto with Jerome. He adapted the tour for my kids. Thanks 🧘‍♂️" },
                { author: "Sophie", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2025-07-31", text: "We met Kevin our guide at AG Coffee, a lovely bright friendly cafe in Sakyo for delicious iced coffee! It was HOT in Kyoto! And then the trek up Daimonji before which we were explained the differences between temples and shrines and what that entails by a very knowledgeable but also equally interested Kevin. He was careful to cater the trip to our needs and interests and was able to adapt when occasion called. Back down the mountain we started off on the Philosophers Path and a visit to Gingakukji. Our guide was excellent about knowing when and how much information to share! After a stop at an" },
                { author: "Mary", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2025-07-08", text: "Excellent. Our guide was able to keep my twin boys cool in the hot weather and entertained. Very nice." },
                { author: "Claire", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2025-06-12", text: "Gef is a really great guide and we thoroughly recommend spending time with him on this tour. He is very knowledgeable and passionate about Japan, architecture and the tour that he gave us, also very relaxed and accommodating. It couldn’t have been better so thanks Gef and good luck with all your future endeavours…we are planning how we can get back to Japan again soon!!! Claire and Stan" }
