  'kinkaku-ji-temple-and-serene-garden-tour-with-tickets': {
            averageRating: 4.39,
            totalReviews: 15,
            guideRating: 4.5,
            valueRating: 4.75,
            reviews: [
                { author: "Leigh", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-07-30", text: "Takashi was a very knowledgeable and informative guide. We were incredibly lucky that it was only our family on the tour, so it was a very personalised visit to the two temples. We learnt a huge amount and got to understand the history and also religion associated with the different places. He took lots of lovely photos of us as a family and created some fantastic memories. He also recommended further places to visit as I love gardens in particular. Would highly recommend." },
                { author: "Mary", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-05-23", text: "Our guide on this tour was Naomi who did an outstanding job explaining the history of the Pavillion and gardens, pointing out the best vantage points, assisting with photos, explaining the social hierachy during the Samurai Era (12-19 Century) and leading a private optional visit to Ninna-ji Temple where she arranged a very interesting meeting with a Buddhist monk. In addition to being very organized and fluent in English, Naomi was exceptionally kind by helping us find our way to an unrelated afternoon tour. This tour and tour guide were highlights of our visit to Kyoto! I highly recommend." },
                { author: "Stephanie", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-04-18", text: "Great, my guide Taka was very experienced and gave a perfect inside in this unique site. A must for every visitor, thank you!" },
                { author: "Jean-Daniel", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-03-09", text: "The tour was great - Harumi was a wonderful tour guide, she was very knowledgeable about both sites, helpful and friendly! The sites themselves were beautiful and tranquil, with lots to learn." },
                { author: "Jeff", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2025-12-29", text: "Satomi was an incredible tour guide. She taught us so much about Japanese history, culture and architecture. She was friendly, knowledgeable, flexible, and fun. She's the right person with whom you want to explore iconic Kyoto sites. We visited Kinkaku-ji and Ninna-ji temples. Everybody knows about Kinkaku-ji but the gardens at Ninna-ji were a wonderful discovery. these two sites offer complementary examples of Japanese Buddhist gardens and religious sites. We would absolutely recommend this tour to anyone who wants a better understanding of Kyoto's Buddhist heritage." },
                { author: "Leyla", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-05-06", text: "Guide très sympathique, lieu magnifique" },
                { author: "Traveller", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-03-22", text: "Excellente et la guide Mika était absolument FANTASTIQUE, passionnante, et à l'écoute. MERCI!" },
                { author: "Monte", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 3, date: "2026-03-12", text: "gros coup de coeur pour le temple d'or qui est magnifique a regarder. Ninna ji est différent, et peu de zones où l'on peut entrer (interdit au public) notre guide Annie était très sympathique et donnait des explications simples (accessibles malgré notre niveau d'anglais moyen)." },
                { author: "Michael", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-02-24", text: "Sehr gut. Der Tour-Guide Taka war sehr freundlich und hat vieles sehr gut und aufschlussreich erklärt. Er hat zudem Fragen schnell, freundlich und erkenntnisreich beantwortet." },
                { author: "Traveller", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2025-07-03", text: "Great. Our tour guide Annie was amazing at answering all of our questions. We really enjoyed seeing the areas not normally viewed. I highly recommend Annie as a tour guide!" }
            ]
        },
