                { author: "Dean", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-05-27", text: "We had a great day in Amanohashidate and Miyama. Our guide Ako led us on a wonderful trip to these locations. We especially enjoyed the views in Amanohashidate and walking through Miyama." },
                { author: "Emi", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-05-24", text: "It was really nice but the rain ruined it 😭 ako was a really nice & lovely tour guide ! The lunch was really yum & flavourful ❤️" },
                { author: "Catherine", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-05-13", text: "Our guide was excellent, funny & knowledgeable. A lot of driving but the day is well planned." },
                { author: "Eric", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-05-10", text: "This was an awesome trip, one of the best so far of our tour or Osaka. Our tour guide Harid was brilliant and very informative. The driver was fantastic as well, cool calm and collected. Harid did really well with a group of 17 guests paid attention to everyone and was a friendly person. Well done guys. Will definitely recommend this tour guide and driver to everyone. Thank you Harid for making this an awesome day" },
                { author: "Erica", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-05-04", text: "Perfect way to end my trip to Japan! Gorgeous views and delicious meal. I really enjoyed seeing the thatched-roof village as well. A definitely highlight of my time in the country!" },
                { author: "Jorja", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-05-04", text: "Had the best day out. The guide was amazing as he spoke different languages for the passengers, the driver was really great also as he navigated some narrow roads so well & kept us safe (had to mention the driver as they do such a great job) Everything was great, food so yummy & attractions were amazing where we went to. Definitely would travel again on this tour with friends & recommend it to people." },
                { author: "Victor", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-04-30", text: "Beautiful tour with very knowledgeable and helpful stuff. Thank you" },
                { author: "Pamela", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-04-24", text: "What an amazing trip! I had a wonderful day visiting the countryside and the coast. The day was a little bit long and we spent a lot of time driving on the bus, but it was totally worth it. Lunch was delicious, the guide was entertaining and informative, and everything we did was interesting and fun. Highly recommended." }
