  'sacred-pathways-discover-the-philosopher-s-path-of-kyoto-by-local-operator': {
            averageRating: 4.91,
            totalReviews: 33,
            guideRating: 4.9,
            valueRating: 4.7,
            reviews: [
                { author: "Wendy", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-06-02", text: "We meet Phillipe and 2 others in the party. We thoroughly enjoyed the tour and the stories about the places. It rained the whole time but we had umbrellas and so much to see. We found it really interesting and Phillippe was able to add to the tour with lots of knowledge and a clear love of Japan and the area. Beautiful spiritual places. 😊" },
                { author: "Willie", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-04-27", text: "This was an excellent guided tour with Niall, he was full of information for us as we walked around the area seeing some amazing sights. Willie & Brenda" },
                { author: "Mark", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-04-25", text: "This was a perfect Kyoto tour. Kevin was intelligent and very knowledgeable. We felt we learned more about Kyoto and the culture and customs of Japan than perhaps any other tour we have taken. Outstanding!" },
                { author: "Margaret", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-04-01", text: "Kevin M was just right for us. He brought knowledge of culture, history and language to his curation of our walk. It rained today, which is not a problem (perhaps a value add) with an umbrella. I felt like our guide brought his grounded presence to our tour. Bravo!" },
                { author: "Vanessa", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-03-26", text: "This tour was wonderful. At first, we thought we were unlucky as we had a very rainy day, however this allowed us to enjoy the Silver Pavilion gardens, pretty much for ourselves. We were lucky to have Phillip as our guide this day as well as he is very well versed with Kyoto history and Zen Buddhism. I highly recommend this tour." },
                { author: "Eric", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-01-02", text: "Kevin was super knowledgeable, personable and fun. We learned so much about Kyoto history and Japanese culture. He also gave great recommendations!" },
                { author: "Marie", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2025-11-17", text: "Excellent Kevin was 10/10 Pity I had to pay extra $ a lot" },
                { author: "Jacqueline", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2025-10-02", text: "We loved this tour! Very relaxed pace, which we really appreciated. Lots of time to take everything in. Kevin was an outstanding host. He had fantastic knowledge of not just what we saw, but the history and culture of Japan. Also wonderful to see things most tourists miss. We hardly saw anyone else about, which was fantastic." },
                { author: "Lisa", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2025-04-18", text: "Loved Craig’s knowledge, easy going approach and sheer pleasure in sharing Kyoto with us. Having lived here for 13 years, he is a committed local but it was so easy for us to ask him lots of questions because he spoke English. It meant we learnt so much more on this gorgeous walk. Totally worth every cent and every step." },
                { author: "Rebecca", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2025-04-12", text: "Kevin was an excellent guide. He provided us with a lot of new information about the location, the history of Japan and the philosopher’s path. He was excellent at keeping his pace to ours. The philosopher’s Way is a fascinating walk and the information that Kevin gave us increased our appreciation of our time in this area." },
                { author: "Margaret", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2025-04-12", text: "Kevin did a great job leading us on a beautiful and informing walk on the Sacred Pathways tour. Kevin was well versed on many topics and easily answered any questions we had. In addition, he seemed interested in who we were and engaged us in conversation. We went slow enough to get some amazing photos along the way. We never would have found all these spots on our own and would highly recommend a guided tour." },
                { author: "Jacqui", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2024-10-26", text: "We really enjoyed the tour and Kevin's knowledge of Kyoto's history, and the history of its temples. It was a pleasant walk, with natural scenery and without large crowds. Definitely recommend to anyone interested in experiencing the history and beauty of Kyoto." }
            ]
        },
