                { author: "Michele", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 1, date: "2026-05-12", text: "We could never find the place." },
                { author: "Alex", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 1, date: "2026-05-08", text: "they should put a disclaimer that its not a group activity , you literaly sit alone and drink sake for 75 minutes and you get a sushi at the end. if you book this take it to consideration, other then that the staff was nice." }
