                { author: "Scott", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 3, date: "2026-09-03", text: "Overall, this tour was good. It definitely hit the highlights but our guide was a little bit of a letdown. He was knowledgeable but you had to pull information from him rather than him talking about what you were doing or seeing." },
                { author: "Anita", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 3, date: "2026-07-19", text: "Il tour è stato personalizzato in base alle mie richieste. La nostra guida è stata molto gentile e disponibile. Tuttavia, le spiegazioni sono state limitate. Mi sarei aspettata maggiori informazioni storiche e religiose. Inoltre, ha fatto molto caldo e il tour è stato molto faticoso. Avrei gradito dei suggerimenti in fase di prenotazione per cambiare orario o ridurre i luoghi da visitare o altri consigli per renderlo meno difficile." },
                { author: "Traveller", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-07-01", text: "I joined this tour hoping to see beautiful scenery, and it turned out even better than I imagined. Beyond the views, the walk through the town—steeped in history—was truly moving. The guide was kind, and I am thoroughly satisfied with the experience." }
