  'private-tour-excursion-to-osaka-kyoto-possible': {
            averageRating: 4.7,
            totalReviews: 37,
            guideRating: 4.8,
            valueRating: 4.5,
            reviews: [
                { author: "Kevin", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-06-01", text: "We had a great trip with our guide Malika to Kobe. She met our group of 8 at our accommodation in Osaka on time and got us on a train to Kobe. We stopped at three Sake Breweries before heading into downtown Kobe for a Kobe beef restaurant for lunch. We then went off to the main Shrine and also came across a festival and parade in downtown Kobe. Our guide was very knowledgeable and informative and listened to what we wanted to do before starting to ensure the tour was what we were looking for." },
                { author: "Suzanne", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-05-06", text: "We had such a great day with Sebastiano in Kobe Japan. He is exactly what you want in a guide and more...knowledgeable, accommodating, spoke perfect English, and has a great sense of humor. We had a blast hanging out with him. He arranged lunch at a fantastic restaurant for us to try the infamous Kobe beef, which was fabulous. If we didn't feel like doing something on the itinerary, he pivoted quickly with other different choices. He was the reason we had such a fabulously fun day in Kobe." },
                { author: "John", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2025-11-09", text: "The tour was a great way to see Kobe. Krisha, our guide was very knowledgeable about the area and was able to explain and answer any questions we had about the city of Kobe. We had a wonderful experience and would recommend this walking tour without reservation. Krisha also made sure that we were able to navigate our way back to the cruise ship. Thank you Krisha" },
                { author: "Phillip", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2025-10-15", text: "Molly built an agenda around our time limits and interests and efficiently moved us through the day to maximize our time. She was knowledgeable about the history and cultural significance of what we visited, and was warm and interactive. A well planned and executed itinerary with lots of cultural background." },
                { author: "Marshawn", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2025-07-30", text: "The activity was catered to our request. So it meets our expectations." },
                { author: "Edwin", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2025-05-14", text: "We had a GREAT day in Kobe Japan. Our guide Camila was outstanding! She was very knowledgeable of the area and took us to some great locations, including China town, National herb garden and Ropeway and the earthquake Memorial wall. Camila spoke great English which made our day that much enjoyable. Great job… thanks again!!" },
                { author: "Thomas", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2025-04-11", text: "We had a very pleasant day with our guide Tony. In the short time he showed us spots to understand japanese history and lifestyle in a very convenient way. He combined our wishes in his program and had always an answer to our questions. Visiting Kobe and Osaka in one day was a fantastic experience. It was a great day with Tony!" },
                { author: "Sharon", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2025-04-11", text: "our guide contacted us in advance to find out what we wanted to do and see. she tailored it to our needs." },
                { author: "Henar", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2024-11-19", text: "We had just some hours to visit Kobe. Allysa adapted quickly and gracefully to our demands and waited patiently for us to arrive in Kobe. She took us to the most famous spots in Kobe, explain the history and traditions and took us to the Shrine, the harbour, the Motomachi shopping street passing by Chinatown. She left us in a restaurant and helped us to order. Everything was easy and well explained. Go and book a tour with her!" },
                { author: "Karen", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2024-04-16", text: "Eva was delightful - enthusiastic and friendly. She showed us some of here favorite special spots in Kobe, finishing with a tasty stop in Chinatown. LOL, it seems funny to eat Chinese food on a visit to Japan - especially Kobe, but we really didn't have time for a Kobe Beef restaurant, and we have had it before. We would highly recommend Eva!" },
                { author: "Ivett", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2024-03-29", text: "Our guide was very kind! He gave us choices on where to go and was very helpful getting us back to the correct station. It’s good to have someone who genuinely loves the area guide you!" },
                { author: "BALDY", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-07-25", text: "Sebastiano nous a montré les lieux emblématiques de Kobe, et nous avons beaucoup apprécié cette balade de 3h, agrémenté d' échanges sur les us et coutumes du Japon ! C'était une belle maniere de connaître cette ville qui merite d'etre visitee... Nous recommandons à 100 % !" }
            ]
        },
