                { author: "Claire", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-03-03", text: "This was a brilliant trip! Well worth it. Cesar was a super guide. He was so knowledgeable and made the day so enjoyable. Bus driver also very pleasant and helpful. Highly recommend this tour. Really enjoyed the day." },
                { author: "Nandani", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-02-27", text: "It was fabulous. Angeles was a superb guide. She effortlessly guided us through three cities. Her English diction was very clear and she explained Japanese history really well. Angeles was also very kind and really cared that we all had a good time. The driver of the bus was very professional and courteous." },
                { author: "VASILEIOS", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-01-05", text: "The itinerary was perfectly balanced, allowing us to experience the calm and tradition of Nara with its famous deer and historic temples, the vibrant energy of Osaka, and the elegance of Kobe—all in a single day without feeling rushed. Everything was extremely well organized, with smooth transportation and clear timing at each stop. Our guide Alessandro was knowledgeable, friendly, and attentive, sharing interesting historical and cultural insights while also giving us enough free time." },
                { author: "Andre", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2025-12-27", text: "Caesar and ikeda-san did aa very good job. this tour is worth every cent. Must do if you are in Kyoto" },
                { author: "Ani", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2025-12-06", text: "Our tour guide Cesar was very knowledgeable about the three cities we visited on our trip. He was able to answer our questions and made us feel so welcome. Would definitely want to fo another tour again with Cesar." }
