                { author: "Traveller", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 1, date: "2026-06-02", text: "The day didn’t go well. The tour guide didn’t have much knowledge about Nara historic sites. She couldn’t provide any history information. We ended the tour about one hour. She was dismissed and sent home." },
                { author: "Traveller", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-05-29", text: "Muy interesante Nara, la Guía nos dio un buen tour y nos llevó a un restaurante tradicional de Udon." },
                { author: "Traveller", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2024-10-23", text: "The Nara Tour was a wonderful mix of history and nature. Todai-ji Temple, with its Great Buddha, was truly awe-inspiring, showcasing the grandeur of ancient Japan. Nara Park, where we fed the friendly deer, added a fun and unique touch to the day. The tour was well-paced, giving just the right amount of time at each spot. It's an ideal way to explore Nara’s cultural highlights in a short visit." }
