                { author: "Violet", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-08-02", text: "It was such a wonderful experience my best friend and I had an amazing time learning about traditional Japanese sweets and our hosts were so friendly and welcoming. We will definitely be back in the future to visit them again." },
                { author: "Joseph", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-07-31", text: "The session kicked off with a brilliant historical overview of wagashi. The provided translator was fantastic—not only translating smoothly, but also sharing fascinating context about the history, seasonal significance, and artistry behind these traditional confections. Learning about the cultural roots made creating the sweets that much more meaningful. When it came to the actual hands-on portion, the master chef was incredible. Warm, friendly, and exceedingly patient, they broke down complex shaping and modeling techniques into clear, manageable steps. Even as a beginner, I felt entirely sup" },
                { author: "Traveller", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-06-20", text: "This was a wonderful experience with a skilled Wagashi master. My 11 year old and I participated and both loved it. Would highly recommend." }
