                { author: "Edward", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-04-01", text: "Excellent… Yukie was enthusiastic and we enjoyed her ability to explain the history of the castle we visited. She was always eager to help us take ‘couple’ shots. Yukie brought us to many interesting shops and showed us the popular eateries at Osu. We even dropped by Muira Knife to savour the varieties of knives there. Last stop was shopping at Golf Partners Victoria! The afternoon was rainy, so we skipped the garden/park." },
                { author: "Richard", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-03-30", text: "We had a fantastic tour of Nagoya. Yuki was absolutely fantastic and was both very knowledgeable and friendly. We both felt that we were privileged to have such a wonderful guide who showed and explained so much to us during a fully packed itinerary. Nothing was too much and we came away feeling that we were a little more knowledgeable about Nagoya and Japanese culture. A five star experience from a five star guide. Thanks again Yuki." },
                { author: "Traveller", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 4, date: "2026-04-03", text: "It was a tour from 9:30 am to 2 pm. We had a group of five tourists. The tour guide was young, friendly nice girl, she took us by taking subway to the famous Nagoya castle, Tsuruma park and Osu shopping district. The weather was fantastic, local people enjoyed the nice weather, foods and the Sakura party. it's fun" },
                { author: "Traveller", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 4, date: "2026-04-01", text: "The trip was good. A d the guide is very helpfull. Thanks" },
                { author: "Traveller", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-03-28", text: "The guide was the best every had gr8" },
                { author: "Traveller", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-03-28", text: "A lovely trip with an excellent tour guide, Yukei, who was very accommodating to the needs of our mini group, as well as friendly and professional. The weather was wonderful, and we were fortunate to see the cherry blossoms in full bloom while also enjoying a good pace throughout the trip and some exciting shopping along the way." }
