                { author: "Alisa", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-06-18", text: "I had a wonderful cooking experience with Yuko. She walked us through the steps to make a delicious Miso Ramen. I am so excited to take the recipe back home and to try it on my own. I highly recommend this class for anyone traveling to Nagoya." },
                { author: "Robert", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-04-21", text: "We had such a lovely time with Michiyo-san and Emi-san. They talked us through the different stages of cooking and explained everything clearly as we worked to create and then eat our own Miso Ramen." },
                { author: "Nallely", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-04-01", text: "Unique and amazing experience! If you come to Japan, this is a must! The staff is friendly and lovely. My friends and I had a lot of fun learning and also making ramen." },
                { author: "Manuel", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2025-10-02", text: "Both Mikito & Michiyo were very personable and made us feel very comfortable right from the start of our time together." },
                { author: "Elizabeth", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2025-08-28", text: "The lesson was awesome! Our two teachers, Yuko and Chinatsu, were absolutely lovely! They walked us though every step of the process to make a delicious ramen we walked away with a copy of the recipe and recommendations on the specific misos to look for in local stores so that we can recreate this dish at home. I highly recommend this experience!!" },
                { author: "Leonardo", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2025-10-14", text: "Mikiko sin da subito é entrata in sintonia con noi. É stato super divertente cucinare e interagire parlando della cultura giapponese insieme a lei. Super consigliato. Peccato che non siamo rimasti più giorni per poter provare anche le altre lezioni di cucina" }
