                { author: "Traveller", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-07-30", text: "This was a very well organised activity, and we could cover a surprising large number of activities in one day!! the stop duration is curated to ensure we are able to complete the planned activity and just enough time to enjoy, savour and move on the next stop! The day was packed yet perfectly paced — from the serene Jingu Shrine to indulgent treats at Shiroi Park and fresh seafood at Jyogai Market. 🍦🦀 The Sapporo Beer Museum stood out with its 150‑year history and the best chilled beer tasting ever. The surreal Hill of the Buddha — complete with Moai statues and Stonehenge — made for unforget" }
