                { author: "Jordana", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-06-08", text: "Had a great time with Elijah! Very informative and friendly. Really enjoyed seeing the sights and being shown the local public transport system. Brilliant intro to Osaka on our first day. Thoroughly recommend." },
                { author: "Doreen", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-05-26", text: "Abi was a wonderful guide. Very pleasant and knowledgeable. The pace was perfect for us. We visited numerous historical sites and never felt rushed. My daughter mentioned her interest in pop culture so was thrilled that this was something Abi also included in parts of her guided tour along with other popular landmarks and attractions. We requested a small lunch break and she found a nice little spot along the way. All in all a great day. Thank you Abi!" },
                { author: "Helmut", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-05-11", text: "We had a wonderful day out in Osaka. Our guide Elijah showed us many interesting places where he always had useful background information. He was very helpful and managed to meet our pace and our interests. All in all it was a very satisfying experience we can wholeheartedly recommend." },
                { author: "Victor", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-04-24", text: "Diego was exceptional. Very knowledgeable and professional. Strongly recommend his services" },
                { author: "Guido", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-04-19", text: "Diego was great provided many insights to the area and history, offered a great lunch option which was really good. He was very well versed on the subways to take I would recommend him" },
                { author: "Craig", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-04-12", text: "Diego was fabulous and a nice guy. We highly recommend him!" },
                { author: "Carol", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-04-11", text: "What a fun morning! Our guide, Diego, met us at our hotel. It was a rainy day and he came prepared with extra umbrellas. We had a really pleasant time touring the beautiful gardens at Osaka Castle while Diego shared its history with us, plus visited several other stops in Osaka that we walked and/or took the train to reach. He also gave us some great restaurant tips and shared insights about Japan and its culture. A tour I would definitely recommend!" },
                { author: "Ulrich", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-04-10", text: "Kieran was a great guide: an expert for Osaka and a very sympathetic fellow. Thank you so much for an incredible journey through the town." },
                { author: "Peter", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-04-05", text: "Kieran was just terrific. Adapted to our needs and we learned a great deal about Japanese culture and history.. Highly recommended." },
                { author: "Natalie", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-04-03", text: "The activity was great. Kieran was very friendly and helpful, and knowledgeable" },
                { author: "Debra", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-03-28", text: "I reflected on my tour the following day and I learnt so much information that just getting around Osaka on my own the following day was so less stressful but also the indepth knowledge about the history was so interesting and enjoyable to listen to. I enjoyed my tour very much. His passion for the city shines through and I felt lucky to have chosen this guide." },
                { author: "Rachel", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-01-03", text: "Kieran was a terrific guide! One of the best mornings we’ve had! He had so much great context and background to share about the landmarks and local culture. He also customized the tour for us on the fly." }
