                { author: "Brown", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-04-10", text: "Ryoko was awsome! Restaurants we went to were authentic and delicious. She introduced us to a lot of new food and drinks that we havn't tried yet. She also took us to a neighborhood japanese sake bar run by a cool man. He provided us the perfect one as his recommendation. Overall, it was an awsome experience and we recommend her!" },
                { author: "R", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-03-17", text: "Had a wonderful time touring the local restaurants and sake tasting flight. Ryoko our guide for the tour was kind, informative, and made the night a truely fun time. Thanks for the great time!" },
                { author: "Arlenis", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-03-16", text: "It was amazing NIGHT. We had such a great time with Saki, our guide. She was so kind, food was delicious! We enjoyed the Osaka's food culture. She took us hidden restaurants and bars where we could never found our own. Japanese Sake tasting flight was also amazing." },
                { author: "Cameron", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-03-11", text: "Ryoko was great guide and bars and food were really nice and authentic. Ending the nightwear in a karaoke. 100% would recommend." },
                { author: "Cameron", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-02-28", text: "Sorry for the late review. Thanks to our guide Ryoko, it was a great tour! She told us the Osakan culture, local rules, we enjoyed local food and Japanese sake. Thank you again!" },
                { author: "R", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-02-23", text: "This tour was amazing! Our guide made the night great!" },
                { author: "Nelson", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-02-22", text: "This was an absolute dream of an experience! Special thanks to our tour guide, Saki, who made it amazing." },
                { author: "Brown", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-02-09", text: "This bar hopping tour was the perfect way to experience Osaka at night. Ryoko was young, friendly, and full of local knowledge, taking us to great spots we never would have found on our own. Trying local food while learning the “no double-dipping” rule was fun, and the sake tasting introduced us to completely different flavors. The night ended at a lively karaoke bar where locals sang English songs with us. Ryoko even took lots of photos and surprised us with a printed photo souvenir — such a thoughtful touch. Highly recommended!" }
