                { author: "Murat", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-06-04", text: "This was honestly one of the highlights of my trip to Japan. Shoki provided a very relaxed and authentic experience that felt completely different from a traditional tour. We explored Osaka, had great conversations, shared perspectives about our cultures, and enjoyed the day at our own pace. What impressed me most was his genuine kindness, flexibility, and ability to create a comfortable atmosphere. The experience felt natural and personal rather than scripted or rushed. I would also like to thank him for his food recommendation—the karaage he suggested was one of the best Japanese dishes I ha" },
                { author: "Natalia", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-05-20", text: "It was an awesome way to explore Osaka, especially it’s great for solo travelers. Loved pictures as well! Totally worth it!" },
                { author: "Traveller", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-04-27", text: "I had a truly great experience. Shoki is a very professional and passionate guy—you can tell he genuinely loves what he does, and he absolutely deserves success in his work. We spent about six hours together, and it was genuinely enjoyable from start to finish—creating content, taking photos, and experiencing authentic moments of the city. He made me feel completely at ease, and everything felt natural and effortless. I can’t wait to receive the final content! I highly recommend this experience to anyone who wants to enjoy Osaka in a unique way and take home high-quality memories." }
