  'kobe-day-trip-with-arima-onsen-and-mt-rokko-night-view': {
            averageRating: 3.7,
            totalReviews: 25,
            guideRating: 4.0,
            valueRating: 3.7,
            reviews: [
                { author: "Millie", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-09-15", text: "This is such a great day trip out of Osaka. It’s worthwhile getting out to see Kobe, a nice change of pace for the day! Our tour guide, NickLee, did a great job of keeping us safe whilst driving, and gave us some great tips and information as the day went on. Thanks!" },
                { author: "Will", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-05-25", text: "Nick was a stellar, personable and engaging driver who gave us loads of free time to explore Kobe Port and Kinato Old Town. The views from Mount Rokko are the most stellar I have ever seen. Thank you, Nick for a wonderful trip. Peace, mate." },
                { author: "George", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-04-26", text: "One of the best experiences of Kobe and the vicinity. It is definitely worth the money" },
                { author: "Margie", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-04-07", text: "So worth it!! Our driver, Nick, was awesome! I recommend this tour to anyone wanting to visit Kobe! Thank you so much!🌸😊🌸" },
                { author: "ROBert", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-02-14", text: "Jack was excellent guide! Great day. Onsen stop a little short but all good." },
                { author: "Sandy", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2025-11-11", text: "Nick was great. He explain the stops and where we can go and whqt to do while we were there and where to meet afterwards. Had a great time. I enjoy the small group and no rush experience" },
                { author: "Caitlyn", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2025-10-29", text: "Our tour guide was awesome! Yang was very friendly and kept everyone on schedule and showed us everything we needed to know. We highly recommend Yang!" },
                { author: "Thi", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2025-10-27", text: "The day trip was excellent , it’s was relaxing and we had enough time in each place to explore and eat if we wished, you get to see all you need in Kobe, the last stop which is the cable car ride city view is very impressive and we got some great photos. Excellent value for money. Our guide ( name was Yang ) spoke excellent English and had extensive knowledge of Kobe which he happily shared with everyone, he was very friendly and happily took pictures for us all. Highly recommend this day trip." },
                { author: "David", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 4, date: "2025-11-06", text: "Brilliant trip some great sights and very well organised. Bit bad that they left one of the party because she was five minutes when some people had been late on previous stops of fifteen minutes and didn't get left. She was a solo female traveller and I felt it was unnecessary to leave her and unfair. Another few minutes and she would have made it. I know they have a schedule to meet but you can't allow some people to be fifteen minutes late and not take action and punish one person for being five minutes late. Totally unprofessional in my opinion" },
                { author: "Traveller", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-05-06", text: "Espectacular 100% recomendado!" },
                { author: "Marilu", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 1, date: "2026-04-17", text: "Solo era un conductor. No hubo explicación de nada, el tiempo en los lugares muy poco para conocer, me quedé con ganas de ir al crucero o a la torre de Kobe, tuve tiempo de ir al onsen, pero no de pasear o comprar en Arima, el tiempo en el monte Rokko insuficiente solo daba para subir y bajar en el cable car. Hice amistad con una familia japonesa, solo por eso valió la pena el paseo." },
                { author: "Mariya", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 3, date: "2026-03-31", text: "This was a good trip with 4 stops: port area, European style mansions, town of Arima and the night view observation area. This was not a tour nor was it guided, so there wasnt any explanation or us walking as a group as you would normally do on a TOUR. The driver, Lin safe driver did his job to drive us but barely spoke English and just dropped us off at each location without giving any background info, interesting facts, history etc. I hope the company prepares better next time!" }
            ]
        },
