  'minoh-waterfall-and-katsuo-ji-temple-half-day-tour-in-osaka': {
            averageRating: 4.67,
            totalReviews: 86,
            guideRating: 4.79,
            valueRating: 4.31,
            reviews: [
                { author: "Jimmy", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-08-29", text: "Harry-san is such a wonderful person! For first-timers in Japan, we would definitely recommend him. His explanations go far beyond simply telling you about the places you’re visiting — we learned so much about Japanese religions, traditions, and local tales, which added so much value to our trip. We’re especially glad that Minoh and Katsuo-ji were among the very first temples and shrines we visited in Japan. Harry-san took the time to show us the dos and don’ts at temples and shrines, and explained how customs differ depending on the type of place you’re visiting. These are the kinds of detail" },
                { author: "Jo", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-08-24", text: "Maria was lovely! She had super clear English and was very knowledgeable of the area. The overall pace of the tour was enjoyable, considering how humid it was. Highly recommend!" },
                { author: "Maria", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-07-17", text: "Maria was absolutely amazing! Even though I was the only person on the tour that day, she kept things super interesting and packed with great info. The spots we visited were beautiful, and moving from the waterfall to the shrine was effortless. I especially loved the shrine tour itself. Having her as my guide truly elevated the whole experience, and I also appreciate her photography skills. 🤩" },
                { author: "Sian", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-07-13", text: "Maria was really friendly and knowledgeable. The hike was not for the faint hearted in the humidity but the waterfall was worth the effort as was the temple. A lovely day." },
                { author: "MP", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-06-23", text: "María is very sweet! She explained everything on detail, she gave us food places suggestions, and she took photos of us in the best spots. Thank you María!" },
                { author: "Lane", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-06-17", text: "This was such a good tour! It was so much better with a guide. He had so much useful information that made it so much more fun. And the little hike to the waterfall was amazing! Since it's so far to get out to Katsouji temple, I think this coupling made a really nice day!" },
                { author: "Kristy", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-05-28", text: "Ako was a lovely guide, a local to the area she was very knowledgeable." },
                { author: "Rachel", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-05-13", text: "AMAZING! Our guide Harry was fantastic, very knowledgeable about everything the tour had to offer, it was only a small group so there was lots of opportunity to have one on one conversation, he was witty and very intelligent, the perfect guide! he even invited us to his favourite restaurant after for sushi, highly recommend! <3" },
                { author: "Jonathan", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-05-05", text: "A great way to see 2 different but beautiful sites in Osaka. The walk to Minho waterfall was lovely with lots to see before reaching the waterfall which was stunning. Katduo-ji temple is brilliant. Very beautiful and with lots to see and do. Maria was a great guide. She was lively, knowledgeable and informative. As a local, she had real passion for the area and gave us some great insight and information." },
                { author: "Marcos", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-04-15", text: "Our guide Kiho was amazing she told us the history of every lactation we went to she was very nice and knowledgeable, we will definitely look for her next time." },
                { author: "Vishal", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-04-15", text: "Our tour was great. it helped that our guide spoke great English, it made it easier to ask questions. They also helped take photo's of us throughout the tour." },
                { author: "Belinda", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-03-29", text: "An incredible experience to escape the hustle and bustle and enjoy the natural beauty of Japan. Our guide Yu was exceptional, sharing unique insights into Japanese culture. This is not to be missed. Wear your walking shoes and enjoy." }
            ]
        },
