  'gion-magical-night-walk': {
            averageRating: 4.83,
            totalReviews: 5,
            guideRating: 4.83,
            valueRating: 4.83,
            reviews: [
                { author: "Vidula", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-05-13", text: "I had an amazing experience on this tour, honestly one of the highlights of my time in Kyoto. Walking through Gion in the evening felt unreal. The streets were peaceful, quiet, and far less crowded than I expected. It truly felt like stepping into another world. Our guide, Kian, was fantastic. Beyond helping us take incredible photos, he also gave me great recommendations and tips for the rest of my time in Kyoto. It felt more like exploring the city with a local friend than being on a typical tour. Dinner at Stars’n Cacio was incredible as well. The omakase course was unforgettable, especiall" },
                { author: "Kyle", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-04-15", text: "It was my first time in Japan, and this Kyoto tour was one of the best decisions I made. Dimuthu was a great guide; friendly, knowledgeable, and really passionate about Gion. The night walk felt special and memorable. It will be in my memory forever. Stars n Cacio was amazing. The omakase was delicious, beautifully presented, and full of great flavors. The service was warm and welcoming. Highly recommended 👍" },
                { author: "Christian", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 4, date: "2026-04-21", text: "Die Tour war sehr schön. Am Abend war eine sehr tolle Stimmung in dem Viertel und es war sehr leer. Der Guide Kian war super behilflich um die besten Fotos zu bekommen. Eigentlich hat uns die Tour super gefallen und hätte 5 Sterne verdient. Wir haben einen Punkt abgezogen, da das Restaurant uns nicht gefallen hat. Es ist zwar unsere eigene Schuld nicht vorher richtig nach dem Restaurant gegoogelt zu haben, aber für uns, (wir kommen nicht nach Japan um dann auch noch extrem überteuert italienisch Essen zu gehen) war es überhaupt nichts. Nur Europäer, keine Einheimischen und das Essen war zwar l" }
            ]
        },
  'stone-seal-carving-workshop-with-calligrapher-in-kyoto': {
            averageRating: 4.88,
            totalReviews: 52,
            guideRating: 4.89,
            valueRating: 4.72,
            reviews: [
                { author: "Eric", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-09-10", text: "Marin was a kind and patient instructor. My hanko stamp turned out great and the calligraphy page was a nice added bonus. I gained a deeper understanding of Japanese culture from this activity." },
                { author: "Krystyna", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-06-23", text: "Marin-san was amazing guide - she made me feel welcomed and introduced me to the stone seal carving step by step. We started with history and theory, then moved to carving itself. Marin-san helped me to find old versions of kanji that perfectly suited my needs. As a person who had no prior experience, I fully recommend this activity." },
                { author: "Sarah", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-05-20", text: "Excellent event. I now have a stamp that describes my martial arts hobby. The location was difficult to find and directions could benefit from a couple of photos showing the byilding." },
                { author: "Lisa", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-05-12", text: "Marin was an amazing guide and I had the best time designing my stamp! Turned out beautifully." },
                { author: "Anna", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-04-14", text: "It was exceptional! Very highly recommended! A lot of fun and the most authentic souvenir to the trip! Thank you, Marin!" },
                { author: "Gabriele", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-04-07", text: "TL;DR: A fantastic experience that I would happily recommend to anyone. I rarely write reviews, but this experience absolutely deserves one. Marin, our guide, was incredibly patient and helpful throughout the entire process. The activity took place in a stunning traditional building, and the atmosphere alone made it worthwhile. As a family of four, each of us came away with a beautiful, handmade memento of our trip to Japan — something meaningful that we will keep and use for years to come. Marin was especially wonderful with our youngest, a rather stubborn 9-year-old who can get discouraged e" },
                { author: "Dan", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-04-03", text: "A lot of fun, despite how intimidating it seemed at the beginning. The instructors were patient and encouraging and got us all through to success!" },
                { author: "JR", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-02-20", text: "This was a lot of fun. Hard work but it came out great. Highly recommended to others." },
                { author: "Lucia", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2025-12-29", text: "We had a great experience, everything was explained very clearly and we also got help to properly translate our name and surname. It is possible to choose the kanji style to your preference. The final results were amazing! I would totally recommend it, a very calming and soothing experience" },
                { author: "TS", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2025-11-26", text: "Marin did a phenomenal job with walking us through the calligraphy and stone carving. We were worried about this being a very touristy activity that would take us away from the city, but we are leaving with fond memories and one of the best mementos of our trip. Marin is an ex-school teacher and you can tell with her patience and teaching abilities. Definitely do this." },
                { author: "Sanne", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2025-11-05", text: "I loved the environment, care of the staff and personal touch. I had chosen not a word but a sentence. They said it would be hard to do but loved the challenge too! They granted me support, time and attention to finish it and helped me getting there. Leaving satisfied after the couple of focus hours that it took to craft my sealstone, a lasting memory!" },
                { author: "Margie", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2025-10-09", text: "A lovely relaxing activity to take a break from the chaos of being a tourist in Kyoto. Marin was patient, attentive and a great teacher. Thank you!" }
            ]
        },
