                { author: "Clare", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2019-12-08", text: "Our guide Agustin was so helpful and friendly. He took us to a lovely temple that wasn't on the main tourist trail, which was a great opportunity to escape the crowds of Kyoto in the autumn colours season. Our walking tour included all the things that we'd expressed interest in when booking. After the tour, Agustin also kindly emailed me information that he had researched for us about a museum exhibition and antique shop because we'd explained that we were interested in Japanese netsuke. Thank you Agustin!" },
                { author: "Heather", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2019-10-31", text: "My guide was wonderful and had great suggestions, very patient with American tourist. I was excited to see everything, he planned a wonderful itinerary. Helpful with train took picture of meeting place." },
                { author: "Joel", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2019-05-13", text: "It was very enjoyable being with Maha. We highly recommend her." },
                { author: "Victor", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2019-04-22", text: "Maha is very welcoming and took us to see a temple and a shrine not available on other tours. She also took us to her favorite restaurant in the village next to the river and the sashimi was excellent! Maha is very kind and brought us a small gift which was delightful. She has a wonderful sense of humor and kindly helped our 13 year old daughter practice speaking French. We’re very grateful for her excellent tour!" },
                { author: "Jesús", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2019-04-17", text: "nos gusto mucho, le dimos una lista de lo que queriamos ver y ella se apego completamente y nos diseño una ruta muy buena que cubria todo lo que se podia ver en 3 horas" },
                { author: "Ramy", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2019-04-16", text: "Maha our tour was amazing & well versed with Kyoto area & took us to the best place that are less crowded. She was also very kind, care & mindful of our 5 month baby. Definitely made our trip amazing in our 1-day tour in Kyoto. thanks again for amazing experience" },
                { author: "Andrew", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2019-03-31", text: "Maha researched and prepared a visit of Kyoto for someone who uses a wheelchair with limited mobility and she was an excellent guide." },
                { author: "DAVID", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2019-03-08", text: "Toan was very knowledgeable. He was very patient and we had a great time hiking to the top of the Fushimi Iñári Shrine, the Higashi Honganji Temple and walking around the Nishi Market." },
                { author: "Mansour", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2018-12-01", text: "Maha was a great companion in Kyoto, she knew a lot of stuff about the culture and the places, I had a great time with such a fabulous person. Thank you very much." }
