            valueRating: 4.92,
            reviews: [
                { author: "Miro", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-08-26", text: "Sam is a very knowledgable guide and great photographer. I went with my daughter, we loved it." },
                { author: "Sue", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-08-16", text: "Sam did a great job and was very flexible about our timing and group’s ability to move around. Would definitely recommend him!" },
                { author: "Kate", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-08-14", text: "Kanishka recommended that we meet for the 6am tour instead of 8am and it was the absolute best decision. It was quiet and peaceful and we walked all the way to the top. It was warm but manageable and we did the whole loop. Kanishka was warm and friendly and told us lots of interesting facts about the history and also Japan. A fabulous trip and really enjoyed it. Glad we did it with a guide. Thank you" },
                { author: "Mark", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-07-23", text: "Sam was an amazing tour guide! It was well worth the time. Sam was very knowledgeable. He made it fun for the kids. And the most amazing part is that he’s a great photographer. We have the best pictures of our trip to Japan thanks to Sam." },
                { author: "Valentina", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-07-18", text: "It was very fun!! Sam gave us a lot of good information about the temple, and had a lot of interesting facts about Japan in general. We recommend the early wake up for less crowds too. Sam knew all the tips and tricks to make the visit so worth it" },
                { author: "Jun", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-07-16", text: "Our guide Sha is very organized and friendly. Sha is very knowledgeable about the history and culture of Japan, he shared with along the way and many practical tips like some hidden gem, the best way to climb to the mountain top. I had an appointment right after tour, Sha made sure that we have enough time to finish the tour and also helped us to call a taxi. Overall, we are happy the service Sha provided and recommend to any one interested touring in Kyoto." },
                { author: "Tobias", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-05-20", text: "Sam was very nice and tried to show us the less packed parts of Fushimi Inari even though it was getting full already. He explained a lot and walked us through the whole grounds and gave good hints for other activities." },
                { author: "Luis", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2025-12-06", text: "Sha was very knowledgeable and engaging. He arrived promptly and shared a lot of interesting facts about the most important Inari Shrine of Japan, as well as its status and symbols. He was always at hand to answer any questions, and added a \"secret\" bamboo forest, as well as a great photo spot along the way. I would definitely do this tour again with Sha." },
                { author: "Jeet", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2025-12-05", text: "Sam was amazing and provided lots of detailed information throughout the tour. choosing the early morning tour was the best decision!" },
                { author: "Julia", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2025-11-20", text: "Sha was the perfect tour guide, he explained everything very well and made sure that I saw all the spots. I highly recommend this tour :)" },
                { author: "Francesco", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2025-10-29", text: "The atmosphere, the info that Kanishka gave me about what we were seeing and overall all the walk." },
                { author: "Ana", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2025-10-05", text: "Sam was a very good tour guide. He answered all our questions and gave us lots of relevant background information regarding the shrine." }
            ]
