  'morning-highlights-e-bike-tour-in-kyoto': {
            averageRating: 4.93,
            totalReviews: 39,
            guideRating: 5.0,
            valueRating: 4.91,
            reviews: [
                { author: "Renai", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-08-23", text: "This was without a doubt the highlight of our Kyoto trip! Our guide, Ty (sp) was knowledgeable, patient and easy to follow. I’d recommend this tour to anyone able to ride a bike!" },
                { author: "Louis", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-08-20", text: "Awesome guide with me this morning. Loved cycling around Kyoto with her." },
                { author: "Rebecca", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-08-02", text: "Great way to get to know the city and see some of the major sites without having to sort out public transport. I highly recommend doing this tour on your first morning in Kyoto." },
                { author: "Claire", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-07-08", text: "The best thing my teenage son and I have done in Kyoto! Our guide Tai was friendly and very informative and made the whole experience fun. Seeing the sites early before too many tourists were about was great but I also really loved cycling through the backstreets and the river bank of Kyoto. Plus e bikes were a revelation - they made the trip so easy. I can’t recommend enough." },
                { author: "Celia", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-05-15", text: "Tai was very welcoming explained how to use the e-bike. He had a good sense of humour which made us all feel relaxed. We visited Shrine & temples he was able to explain the brief history and the religion. Tai was so good at reading the group . What I particularly liked about Tai was he didn’t ‘overload ‘ us with to much information. The tour went quickly ,a lovely ride along the river and we all came back happy and informed. Thank you Tai" },
                { author: "Melissa", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-04-12", text: "Fantastic bike tout of Kyoto, especially the Gion section. The guide was pleasant and very knowledgeable." },
                { author: "Sigrid", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-03-27", text: "Had an amazing time!!🌟 Our lovely guide showed us around a lot of the popular spots beating the worst crowds by starting at 7 am. She was super knowledgeable and nice - would definitely book again!" },
                { author: "Abigail", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-02-09", text: "We had a lovely ride through all the highlights of Kyoto. Aska was very friendly and made us all feel welcome. Our group ended up being the only ones on the tour so it was as if we had booked a private tour. The e-bikes are well maintained and easy to use and are a must have for the big hills." },
                { author: "Belinda", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-01-26", text: "What a magical way to see Kyoto! I cannot recommend this tour and our guide highly enough. The eBikes are in fantastic condition and made climbing the hills a breeze. There was a perfect balance between cycling, sightseeing and learning about Kyoto's history and culture. Seeing the sun rise over the city made the brisk, early start completely worth it!" },
                { author: "Rebecca", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-01-25", text: "We had an excellent tour with Aska. Her English is perfect and she provided great information for both the children and us about the sites. Also a safe path for riding the bikes and heading out early morning was a great way to beat the crowds and get the day started. Thankyou for a memorable experience" },
                { author: "Fam.", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-08-14", text: "We hebben veel gezien en de tour was ook flexibel gezien de plaatsen waar we al geweest waren. De e-bikes werkten prima" },
                { author: "Traveller", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-08-13", text: "Fijne tocht op een tijdstip dat het nog rustig is in de stad. Goede gids met elektrische fietsen dus bergop naar Kiyomizu Dera geen probleem" }
            ]
        },
