  'kyoto-geisha-walking-tour-gion-district-and-local-sites-by-local-operator': {
            averageRating: 5.0,
            totalReviews: 16,
            guideRating: 5.0,
            valueRating: 5.0,
            reviews: [
                { author: "Traveller", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-05-21", text: "One of my favorite experiences in Japan—peaceful, cultural, and full of pleasant surprises. Highly recommended!" },
                { author: "Traveller", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-04-24", text: "This Kyoto night walking tour is absolutely worthwhile. Stroll through old streets in the evening, where traditional historic buildings glow under warm lights, creating stunning scenery perfect for photos. The route is well-planned with an easy, leisurely walk suitable for everyone. The guide delivers clear, easy-to-understand explanations and shares interesting background stories of each spot. There are far fewer crowds at night, offering a peaceful and relaxing way to admire Kyoto’s beautiful evening scenery. Ideal for a slow walk with friends or partners. Highly recommend this night tour wh" },
                { author: "Traveller", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-04-24", text: "Highly recommend this night tour! As night falls with gentle evening breezes, every shot turns out stunning. The itinerary is well arranged at a relaxed pace, and the tour guide delivers vivid and engaging commentary throughout." },
                { author: "Traveller", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-04-23", text: "David was our guide, and we had an amazing evening. He provided informative commentary throughout the tour, and was patient, friendly, and quick to answer all our questions. He also took many beautiful group photos for us. We got to discover unique local scenery that you would rarely find on your own in Kyoto at night. Thank you so much to David for his dedication and excellent service!" },
                { author: "Traveller", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-04-22", text: "Mio was an amazing guide! The evening tour was perfect—nice and quiet, so we could move around comfortably. There was quite a bit of walking, but it was totally worth it. Would absolutely recommend to everyone!" },
                { author: "Traveller", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-04-22", text: "We had the most wonderful tour of Higashiyama with our guide. She was very knowledgeable, answered all our questions patiently, and gave us plenty of time to walk around and take photos.It was lovely to explore the area without huge crowds, and we really appreciated her useful recommendations both during and after the tour. It was a truly memorable and enjoyable experience." },
                { author: "Traveller", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-04-20", text: "This was a relaxing and beautiful walk from Hanamikoji to the Takase River. The pace was perfect and the atmosphere was unforgettable." },
                { author: "Traveller", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-04-17", text: "Our guide was very knowledgeable and explained everything in a clear and engaging way. It made the whole experience much more meaningful." },
                { author: "Traveller", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-04-16", text: "We joined this tour during cherry blossom season and it was amazing. Walking along the streets with blooming sakura and feeling the hanami atmosphere in the evening was unforgettable. The guide also gave great insights about Kyoto." },
                { author: "Traveller", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-04-16", text: "A very pleasant and relaxing experience. Exploring the canal area and small streets with a local guide helped us see a different side of Kyoto. The guide also recommended some great places to eat and explore afterward." },
                { author: "Traveller", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-04-10", text: "We really enjoyed exploring Kyoto in the evening. The crowds were much smaller and the atmosphere felt very relaxed. Walking along the Takase River and around the Kiyamachi area was beautiful, and our guide shared many interesting stories about the city." },
                { author: "Traveller", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-04-10", text: "If you want to experience a more authentic side of Kyoto nightlife, this tour is definitely worth joining. Walking through the historic streets and along the canal felt peaceful and romantic. There were many small local bars, and we stopped for a drink and some light snacks. The pace of the tour was comfortable and it was a wonderful cultural experience." }
            ]
        },
