                { author: "Kimberly", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2019-04-20", text: "My guide was awesome. She showed me so many beautiful and interesting places! I had so much fun with Ina! Thank you so much!" },
                { author: "Traveller", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2024-04-09", text: "Our guide Eugene customized our tour. He was extremely knowledgeable and accommodating. We had a great time." },
                { author: "DR.", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2024-04-09", text: "Toller Guide: inhaltlich, persönlich und sprachlich! Besser geht es nicht!" },
                { author: "Traveller", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2024-04-02", text: "Der tourguide war sehr nett; wir haben viel von narra erfahren. Jede Frage konnte beantwortet werden. Eine sehr abwechslungsreiche, angenehme Tour mit Eugene. Wir können den Anbieter bzw. Tourgide nur empfehlen" },
                { author: "Traveller", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2023-10-14", text: "Andrew was a great guide who knows the history and culture of Nara. He was a pleasure to walk through the Naramachi with. It was a great way to start my adventures in Nara!" },
                { author: "Traveller", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 1, date: "2023-05-18", text: "Unfortunately, the experience with the tourguide didn’t meet our expectations. The information was not apropiate" },
                { author: "Martha", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2023-05-14", text: "Nuestra guía Carolina muy linda, nos platicó muchos detalles de la cultura japonesa! Fueron unas horas muy a gusto con ella en donde aprendimos mucho! Caminamos por todos los puntos de la ciudad que queríamos ver!" },
                { author: "Tommy", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 1, date: "2023-04-23", text: "The worst tour guide we've ever had! We've done eight guided tours during our stay in Japan. Our guide, Paul, provided little to no information on what we were seeing. For instance, we walked by a temple on our way to Nara Park and asked what one of the structures was for and he said, \"Probably where the monks slept.\" All he did was talk about himself and his personal life. This is what he only talked about! Absoutely awful guide! All he did was snap a few photos and basically accompany us on the bus and through the park. We didn't need this, we wanted to learn about the culture and history. W" }
