            valueRating: 5.0,
            reviews: [
                { author: "Vivian", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-05-13", text: "This was a great experience! Very relaxing and fun to work on a little figurine :) The guidance was clear and helpful, and as a bonus we got a bunch of tips on where to eat and go!" },
                { author: "Hilarion", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-03-24", text: "Had an absolutely wonderful time making these creations and just talking with our host in general! He welcome us with hojicha tea before we started and then walked us through the steps of how to mold our deer. From there we were able to customize our deer exactly how we wanted them to look and I’m very excited to receive them in the mail in a couple of weeks!" },
                { author: "Traveller", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-07-06", text: "Such a fun and unique way to remember our trip. I went with my 10-year old so it was a nice shared experience and he enjoyed it as did I. The studio is a short walk from the train station but a little out of the way allowing us to see a side of Nara outside the tourist areas. The teacher was nice and patient and gave us some local recommendations. I can’t wait to receive the deer in the mail and see our final product." },
                { author: "Fabian", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-03-29", text: "Sehr interessanter Workshop, die Schritte wurden gut erklärt und vorgemacht. Man kann die Figur von Posen und aussehen auch sehr individuell gestalten, was im einem Unikat resultiert. Definitv ein schönes selbstgemachtes Souvenier, statt \"nur\" eine kleine Figur in einem Shop zu kaufen. Da der Kurs in einem sehr kleinen Kreis stattfand war auch Zeit für ein paar Unterhaltungen mit dem Kursleiter. Danke noch einmal hierfür. Freue mich schon sehr auf das Endergebnis! (Welches nach Hause geschickt wird)" }
            ]
