                { author: "Ethan", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-08-13", text: "Yu was incredible! We were a group of 5, with three children of different ages. Yu was able to engage with each others of us. She was highly knowledgeable and extremely attentive to all details, also providing helpful tips and even some yummy snacks. This is a great tour—and we highly recommend Yu!" },
                { author: "manita", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-08-04", text: "Was a really fabulous trip, the guide was full of information about the places" },
                { author: "Chenoa", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-07-26", text: "Our Tour guide, Yu, sent a reminder message the day before with when and where to meet, and what she'd be wearing so we could recognise her. On the day, it ended up being just my mum and I as the group and she helped us get our own Suica cards to use all throughout Japan. Yu was very polite, friendly and helpful. Taking us to Miyajima, she explained clearly how the day would pan out, timings and answered any questions we had. Conversations were educational, open and honest, and genuinely such a really fun day! She went at our pace and gave us plenty of time to take pictures and go shopping. Go" },
                { author: "Iana", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-07-24", text: "I loved my time with Yu! She is super knowledgeable and caring guide, trip itself was very well planned and she shared a lot of knowledge about locations and Japan as well. Thank you again for the wonderful day." },
                { author: "Regina", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-07-16", text: "We had an amazing day exploring Hiroshima and Miyajima. Everything was very well organized, and the tour was the perfect mix of history, culture, and beautiful scenery. Our guide, Yu, was exceptional. She explained everything clearly, answered every question with patience, and was always kind, thoughtful, and professional. Her attention to every guest made us feel very welcome throughout the entire tour. Thank you, Yu, for your dedication and hospitality. We learned so much and created wonderful memories. We highly recommend this tour to anyone visiting Hiroshima. It was a truly unforgettable" },
                { author: "Dona", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-07-02", text: "Our guide, Yu, was very organized and got us through the day despite the heavy rain. Miyajima island was actually beautiful under the rain and clouds, which made the floating shrine appear even more mystical and sacred. We also got to interact with several deers wandering around. Finally, our visit of the Hiroshima Peace Park, Museum, and the personal stories Yu shared were really poignant and will stay with us beyond this trip. This was well worth the experience!" }
