                { author: "Bryan", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-07-26", text: "kaku has been an amazing tour guide with lots of knowledge about the place. he answered all of our questions and also managed to make us live as much as locals as possible. highly recommend" },
                { author: "Carlos", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-07-25", text: "Our guide, Kaku, was great. Very knowledgeable and patient to answer all questions you may have about the tour area or Japan. We had an amazing time, highly recommend booking this tour!" },
                { author: "Warwick", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-07-20", text: "Excellent, especially as high tide and not too many people." },
                { author: "Claus", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-07-15", text: "The tour with Kaku was great! We went to see different Torii gates and the famous one of Miyajima. Including visiting the shrine Itsukushima jinja and Daishoin temple. We also had time to go through the shopping district where my son tried fresh grilled oyster for the first time and the local momiji cake! Highly recommended!" },
                { author: "Kellyn", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-06-29", text: "Kaku was an incredible guide!!! He was very friendly and knew all of the hidden gems on Miyajima Island, including the best spots to take pictures and see the roaming deer. The attention to detail and invitation to participate in prayer was great and we even managed to see a wedding! Overall an amazing tour. Would highly recommend!" },
                { author: "Isabelle", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-06-06", text: "We had a brilliant afternoon exploring Miyajima Island! Such a beautiful and breathtaking place, and we got to see so much! Beth was so lovely as a guide and made us feel very comfortable, while ensuring that we had the best possible experience. Would highly recommend for anyone looking to make the most of their visit!" },
                { author: "Andrea", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-05-29", text: "This tour was great! Kaku was an amazing tour guide and was able to tell us everything about the island and take us to all the cool spots. Very worth the money and would highly recommend!" },
                { author: "Martin", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-05-28", text: "Loved this tour with Kaku who was an outstanding guide. He speaks very good and clear English which is also nice. We highly recommend this tour!" },
                { author: "Saverio", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-05-26", text: "Kaku is an excellent guide and teammate to spend an unforgettable day in Miyajima. Open to answer to any question and to any need, as well as to talk about Japan and abroad culture exchanges. Hope to meet him again! Strongly recommended" },
                { author: "Jan", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-05-20", text: "Our guide Kaku was exceptional . His English is brilliant and he was very informative . We wanted to meet him and travel to the Island a different way and he was very nice about it ." },
                { author: "Lane", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-05-19", text: "This was soooo nice! It was good to have our guide meet us to take the ferry (although it was super easy). She took us to a smaller shrine where there aren’t tourists, so it was nice to visit. Was exciting to see all the deer. She made she we had her recommended oysters and they were fantastic. Pey was amazing and had good background on everything and showed us her personal favorite spots!" }
