                { author: "Tina", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-06-26", text: "We loved the tour. Maria was very informative and was happy to answer all our questions. we weren't rushed at all and saw all the highlights of the area. We got a lot more out of the visit than we would have done walking around ourselves. We also really enjoyed her recommendation for place to get okonomiyaki for lunch too! We have no hesitation in recommending Maria and this Hiroshima tour." },
                { author: "Claire", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-05-30", text: "The tour was great and Maria was awesome! She added great insights and had good commentary about Hiroshima’s past and present history. We were lucky to catch a school group singing the peace song at the Sadaki statue and got to meet with the Hiroshima survivor who can often be found at the Abomb dome. Would recommend!" },
                { author: "De", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-05-14", text: "Top-tier tour! We had a wonderful walking tour with Ihsan around the Hiroshima Peace Memorial Museum. Ihsan was very professional and has a wealth of knowledge about Japan’s history, culture, and customs. We highly recommend this company and look forward to using their services again. Thank you for a great experience." },
                { author: "Olivia", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-05-01", text: "We had a really great tour with Maria. It was very insightful and we got to learn the story of Hiroshima and the atomic bomb step by step following related places in the memorial. Maria answered all our questions and took great care of the group. I highly recommend booking the tour with her :)" },
                { author: "Paula", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-04-06", text: "Everything was wonderful! We missed our first train from Osaka, and Maria was nice enough to wait for us and adjust the schedule accordingly. She was also very accommodating with my mother who is in a wheelchair, and she was extremely informative." },
                { author: "Anna", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2025-10-23", text: "Maria is an amazing guide, knows a lot of details about Hiroshima’s past and present and is able to tell stories a way that we couldn‘t stop listening to her. The tour is of perfect length and so interesting, including the museum. We were lucky to even have a private tour. What an afternoon! Thank you, Maria. I hope many more visitors can listen to these stories, remember the past and make the future a better place." },
                { author: "JC", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2025-10-19", text: "James was very knowledgeable and while we knew about what happened at Hiroshima, we came away having learned quite a bit more!" },
                { author: "Carrie", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2025-07-02", text: "Maria was wondeful! Really informative ,friendly and engaging . Thank you! Highly recommended!" },
                { author: "Nadine", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2025-04-27", text: "Maria was a wonderful guide and knew a lot. It’s a tough topic but she made it not too hard to stomach. Can recommend!" },
                { author: "Gordon", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2025-04-04", text: "Ali was excellent and I cant thank him enough. He took the time to get to know us and talk about each part of the park. He didnt rush us and let us ask plenty of questions and explore each area of the park and museum. For the quality of the tour and the time he spent with us, it was fantastic value." },
                { author: "Christine", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2024-10-24", text: "I really enjoyed this private tour. Ihsan is a passionate and knowledgeable guide so the tour was very interesting. I learned a lot and I had a great time. As this was a private tour we had the opportunity to change a bit the initial itinerary to fit and answer my questions and curiosity. I recommend such tour. Thank you Ihsan." },
                { author: "Kaylene", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2024-10-04", text: "Our guide was informative and really enthusiastic about telling the history. It rained the whole time but that did not dampen the enthusiasm and our tour was great. It was well structured but had enough flexibility for us to ask questions and deviate a little to suit our needs. So glad we did this." }
