                { author: "Traveller", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-05-07", text: "This tour was both entertaining and educational, a rare combination indeed. The biggest standout was our tour guide ,was she insightful, but also cheerful and very helpful with accommodating my family needs. I would highly recommend this tour to anyone who wants to learn and explore Japanese culture." },
                { author: "Traveller", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-05-07", text: "Glad we booked this tour, it was totally worth it getting a dive in on the history of Hiroshima. Afterwards, we took a boat going to Miyajima Island. We get to experience roaming around with the deers, eat delicious oyster and visit the shrine. This was possible with our amazing tour guide Kane and our driver Masa. Kane was very organized and gave us ample time in each spot which didn’t feel rushed and very knowledgeable which made our experience the best ever." },
                { author: "Traveller", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-05-07", text: "My family and I really enjoyed the Hiroshima and Miyajima day tour! We came from Osaka and it was convenient since the meeting place is just nearby from the shinkansen station. definitely recommend this tour!" }
