            valueRating: 4.77,
            reviews: [
                { author: "Benjamin", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2025-07-26", text: "Our guide Kaku was amazing. He took us to the local hotspots that tend to not where the tourists go including this incredible curry restaurant. Both my partner and myself don't like curry all the much but decided to give it a try as it had been a while and walked away from the meal being easily one of the best meals we had. He was very knowledge and easy to talk too." },
                { author: "Jens", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2025-03-24", text: "a really personal welcome by Ken our guide who shared a lot of insights with us. he speaks great English, easy to understand and shares a lot of insights also from his personal family history in Hiroshima. he shared a lot of information about the A-bomb diem, the peace memorial and the japanese garden. Next to the historical sights the restaurant Okamoto's has been a real highlight." },
                { author: "Kathy", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2024-06-05", text: "Ken was our guide and did a great job! Very informative and made sure we had a good experience," },
                { author: "Jared", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2024-05-13", text: "John was knowledgeable and delightful to spend a day with. He customized the tour for us. Coming off the cruise ship he met us at the dock and made sure we got back on time for sailing." },
                { author: "Milan", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2024-05-13", text: "Exceptional Hiroshima Tour with Masa: A Journey of Insight and Generosity We had the tour of Hiroshima with Masa. Despite the rain, she led us through the city and adjusted the program according to the weather. We visited the Museum of Peace together, and she kindly covered the entrance fee for us due to the unfortunate weather. The museum admission is not usually included in the program, so we truly appreciated Masa's generosity. We especially liked that she is a native of Hiroshima herself, providing us with great insight into the life of Hiroshima and its history. Masa also shared a lot of" },
                { author: "Robert", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2024-03-16", text: "Maki our tour guide was absolutely brilliant. Spoke excellent English, had fantastic knowledge and had several anecdotes to bring the story of Hiroshima to life. Having a local explain the history and culture is invaluable to add to the whole experience." },
                { author: "Natacha", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2024-01-22", text: "My host was extremely informative. Catered to my needs and what I wanted to see. Made for an extremely pleasant experience." },
                { author: "Edwin", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2025-08-08", text: "Yuka war eine tolle guide. Sehr offen und mit Sachverstand hat sie uns durch hiroshima geführt." },
                { author: "Sergio", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2024-06-08", text: "Guia Masayo excelente. Passeamos pela cidade em um ambiente harmonioso e com relatos impactantes sobre esse período triste a nossa história. Recomendamos esse tour maravilhoso." },
                { author: "Traveller", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2024-05-31", text: "We spent 4h with Tom and visited A- bomb dome and museum and Hiroshima castle. Tom was great and would definitely recommend" },
                { author: "Traveller", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2024-04-01", text: "Die Tour war sehr beeindruckend und informativ." },
                { author: "Uwe", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2024-03-12", text: "Sehr gute Organisation; Abholung vom Hotel und zwangloser Gang durch die Stadt. Akane war höflich, motiviert und führte uns wunderbar durch Hiroshima" }
            ]
