                { author: "Joseph", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-04-22", text: "Our tour guide Joe is an amazing person and was able to provide a lot of detail and history behind all the sights which made visiting them more interesting." },
                { author: "Natalia", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-04-16", text: "Fantastic experience! The views were breathtaking and the itinerary was perfect. Huge thanks to our guide, Joe Lee, for being so attentive and fun. He is incredibly knowledgeable and offers a great perspective on the local sights. Definitely worth it!" },
                { author: "David", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-04-13", text: "The day trip was amazing! The tour guide, Catherine, spoke many languages fluently and was very clear with her communication, on expectations of the trip, duration of each tourist spot as well when to meet back at the bus. She knows Hokkaido quite well, makes further recommendations of what we could do during our stay. She is very polite, prioritises being on time so that we could make it to each destination and spend a sufficient amount of time enjoying the attraction. The driver also helped ensured that we got to our destination safely and on time. Hell Valley was beautiful, scallop lunch at" }
