                { author: "Sarah", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-02-21", text: "Very pleasant trip and really sweet and pacient instructor!" },
                { author: "L", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-02-06", text: "Great guides and bus driver! Super friendly and professional. Great experience with the ski resort. Excellent skiing. Bus driver was great driving in snow. I would book this tour again. Thank you Leo and team!" },
                { author: "Bianca", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-01-27", text: "I booked the ski with an instructor. It is definitely your moneys worth. The guides and instructors are very helpful and professional and the guides help you through everything and he took many photos and videos as well. I would 100000% recommend this event." },
                { author: "Richard", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-01-14", text: "Staff very friendly & informative. Easy getting the equipment Good facilities at the ski resort. Cpuld have spent more time on the ski run itself, felt that only 2 goes was not enough. staff" },
                { author: "Jenny", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-01-10", text: "It was super fun, relaxed and well organised. The staff were friendly and very kind. Had an amazing time stress free" },
                { author: "Alizia", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2025-12-18", text: "I booked snowboarding. The guide is a pro at snowboarding, is really friendly and talkative and will slide next to you to take some videos or photos of you. Overall really exciting and pleasent experience. 5/5 would book this trip again :)" },
                { author: "Lucie", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-03-15", text: "Very good. Guide explained things very well." },
                { author: "Anais", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-02-05", text: "Super expérience, si vous êtes confirmé ou intermédiaire en ski / snowboard, ne vous embêtez pas à prendre le guide, vous pouvez faire les pistes seuls ! Super pratique et super sympa comme domaine ! A faire sans hésiter !" },
                { author: "Traveller", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-01-26", text: "Amazing amazing day of snowboarding , super duper friendly guide , super super awesome and cool, definitely recommend everyone , awesome gear too," },
                { author: "Allan", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 3, date: "2026-01-24", text: "Det startede lidt kaotisk med mødested - havde et mødested ,men ikke præcist hvor. Der var hundrede af mennesker og mange guider fra andre selskaber. Jeg var forvirret og kunne ikke spotte nogen guide med “ski day tour” - da tiden var løbet ud og jeg var ved at give op - kom en guide forbi mig med et skilt der kunne antyde min destination - det var så heldigvis vores guide. Tur til sted med skitøj og støvler gik godt. Ankommet til skisport sted blev igen lidt kaotisk - fik kun at vide at vide at min ski instruktør hed Ken - blev ikke introduceret for ham ved ankomst men istedet sendt i lockerr" },
                { author: "Traveller", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-01-16", text: "It was a fun experience chomping through the snow. Guide Yama was experienced, detailed and shared a lot of stories. Would recommend for those who loves hiking." },
                { author: "Traveller", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2025-12-30", text: "Had an amazing first snowboarding experience thanks to Ken and Yang. Their teaching was incredibly clear, patient, and encouraging, which made learning fun. Couldn’t have asked for better instructors for a first time on the slopes!" }
