  'lake-toya-and-noboribetsu-jigokudani-valley': {
            averageRating: 4.64,
            totalReviews: 195,
            guideRating: 4.76,
            valueRating: 4.59,
            reviews: [
                { author: "Tri", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-03-28", text: "We had an amazing experience with our tour guide Sunny. From the very beginning, they were friendly, professional, and incredibly knowledgeable. They explained the history and culture in a way that was easy to understand and really engaging, and they also shared local tips we would never have found on our own. The pace of the tour was perfect — not rushed, but we still saw so many highlights. They were also very attentive, making sure everyone was comfortable and answering all our questions with patience. What really stood out was their enthusiasm and passion, which made the whole experience f" },
                { author: "Dhini", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-03-21", text: "Our guide, Triple-stone was very informative. The structured about the one day trip was also very nice. I enjoyed every place that I visit, the timing also good enough. The coach in snow-mobile were very professional and patient." },
                { author: "Jessica", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-03-20", text: "The guide Sunny was really nice and knowledgeable. I saw a lot on the tour and had a good time." },
                { author: "Vaz", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-02-20", text: "An well planned and executed trip with some of the most beautiful scenery. Our guide was great at explaining the itinerary and making sure we kept the momentum. Highly recommended!" },
                { author: "Geoffrey", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-02-18", text: "Great tour, snowmobile experience was amazing. Lots of time at each attraction. Mila the guide was informative, friendly and professional. Thanks again for the great day." },
                { author: "Chris", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-02-14", text: "Awesome day! The schedule was perfectly timed with some of the most scenic spots across Hokkaido. Lin was an extremely kind, friendly tour guide and very knowledgeable not only about the activities but about the culture too. Thank you for all your recommendations and your kindness - returning my belongings which I left on the bus too! 🙏" },
                { author: "Devin", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-02-12", text: "Every location, every activity, every bit of information that our guide, Mr. Hong, shared made me feel like I was on a quality tour. The time spent at each location never felt too long nor too short. Mr. Hong was considerably knowledgeable about each location and very accommodating to everyones’ needs on the tour. The day went by so quickly with all the fun we were having! It was a real treat booking this tour because had my fiancé and I tried to visit these locations ourselves, we probably would not enjoy all the knowledge from the tour and would probably have great difficulty commuting to th" },
                { author: "Maria", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-02-09", text: "The tour was well paced. I highly recommend taking the snowmobile option, we were lucky the sky cleared during our snowmobile break and we has a breathtaking view of Lake Toya which was perfect for photos! Noboribetsu Jigokudani Valley is also quite a sight with the steam and snow! Just be careful walking on the boardwalk as it sometimes gets slippery. Our guide, Sunny, was awesome! He speaks fluent English and Mandarin and was able to explain the sights and instructions very clearly. He went the extra mile and took photos and videos of everyone INDIVIDUALLY during the snowmobile activity and" },
                { author: "Janet", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-02-02", text: "The trip was good. Very organized and the tour guid and driver stayed on top of everything. Highlight of the trip is the snowmobile. I had my 5 yr old kid behind me on the snowmobile. I would recommend this tour" },
                { author: "Lin", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-01-12", text: "It was a wonderful experience. The tour guide Mr Hong was excellent—friendly, knowledgeable, and always sharing interesting insights about the local history and culture during the bus ride. The snowmobile experience was definitely the highlight of the trip. The timing was perfect, as it had snowed the day before, so the snow conditions were ideal and the scenery was absolutely stunning. Everything came together for a perfect day." },
                { author: "Ma", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-01-09", text: "Our guide was terrific. He was very informative and very helpful. The tour itself was great. We super enjoyed the snowmobile ride. It rained for the whole hour though so we were soaked through in the cold. It would have been nice if the tour had provided us with plastic raincoats like we saw with the other tour groups. Other than that it was a great day tour" },
                { author: "Jenny", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-01-09", text: "Snowboarding guide Young was so patient and kind. Aslong as you choose the right selection, everything is taken care of for you from bus, to gear to equipment. Highly recommend for anyone who wants a beginner friendly day trip out to the slopes! (But you can also choose no instructor and run free on your own!" }
            ]
        },
