                { author: "Emma", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-07-31", text: "We thoroughly enjoyed our experience of making a unique ring to remember our time in Kyoto. We made two beautiful rings and necklaces. Rena helped us with the whole process and was extremely welcoming. Definitely recommend!" },
                { author: "Melanie", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-07-30", text: "Rana was an excellent and patient guide who walked us through all the steps and helped when needed! We are all very happy with our rings and love the option for necklaces and keychains! What a wonderful activity to do that was a nice respite from the heat and endless walking :)" },
                { author: "aharon", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-07-29", text: "perfect explanations from an expert professional, leading to wonderful results and memories" },
                { author: "Melissa", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-07-29", text: "This was such a beautiful little studio and was such a nice way to spend an hour. We had so much fun. The tour guide is lovely and very helpful. Definitely a must do in Kyoto" },
                { author: "Savyon", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-07-25", text: "Rena was super nice and guided me through the whole process. I was planning on making a ring. But the process was so fun that I ended up making 2 more necklaces and another ring in different colors for an additional small fee. It was a great experience and I’d recommend it to anyone I know that visits Kyoto!" },
                { author: "Angel", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-07-24", text: "Such a fun experience, Rena helped us with the making process. Very smooth and simple process. Great array of coin options and some fun cost effective add ons available with no strong upsell push. A must do when in Kyoto. Amazing!" },
                { author: "Kevin", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-07-21", text: "Amazing experience with long lasting souvenir from our trip to Japan. Rena guided us perfectly through every step with her kind manner! Thanks again! :-)" },
                { author: "Bienvenido", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-07-21", text: "Actually fun and not complicated. I’d recommend to those who wants a personalized item from Kyoto :)" },
                { author: "Jake", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-07-21", text: "It was lovely having Rena show me the process of making my ring! I also got the necklace for my girlfriend which will make a great gift! 100% recommend doing this if you are visiting Kyoto!" },
                { author: "Isaac", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-07-17", text: "This was such an incredible experience. It was hands-on and a wonderful token from our stay in Kyoto." },
                { author: "Manal", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-07-15", text: "It was so much fun and a very special experience. After we made our rings we couldn’t believe it used to be a coin just 20min earlier. Rena took us trough the process and she was not only very kind but also helpful and experienced. Thank you for this experience! We will do it again next time we come to Kyoto :)" },
                { author: "Arthur", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-07-15", text: "Really enjoyed the experience. Lots of hands on making, shaping, punching out the hole and adjustments plus the final polishing makes all the difference. Both mine and my wife’s came out sparkling. Plus the extra cost for the pendant was worth it. Looks amazing. Thank you" }
