  'enjoy-sushi-and-market-tour-best-for-family-and-couple-in-kyoto': {
            averageRating: 4.86,
            totalReviews: 24,
            guideRating: 4.82,
            valueRating: 4.64,
            reviews: [
                { author: "Oliver", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-05-21", text: "That was such a nice experience! We truly enjoyed our Sushi class in this nice cooking school. Our Guide had everything prepared and welcomed us warmly. She explained the process of preparing the rice, the soup and how to cut the fish. Then we already went hands-on and made our own sushi and soup. During the meal our guide was explaining a lot about Japanese culture and gave us nice tips of her favorite restaurants and bars. Highly recommend this class! Thank you for this unique experience!" },
                { author: "Grace", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-01-05", text: "An absolute highlight of our family Kyoto trip! Our guides were kind, knowledgeable, and incredible teachers. I can’t recommend this tour enough for anyone visiting Kyoto. It’s most definitely a must-do! We got to see how the salmon is cut at the fish market, make miso soup, and then make three different types of sushi and it was all topped off with sake, green tea, and a homemade matcha dessert. Incredible doesn’t express how cool this experience was. Out of the many things we saw and did in Kyoto, this topped it all. JUST BOOK IT!!" },
                { author: "Allyn", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2025-11-01", text: "Our guide was so lovely and extremely helpful in making sure we learned the right techniques but flexible enough to help us explore our own flavors. E always wanted to prepare great sushi, and she has given us the skills to make it happen. Very gracious guide and her facilities were very professional. Highly recommended." },
                { author: "Joanne", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2025-05-16", text: "Very informative and interesting. Jenna was a great guide . Sushi was delicious" },
                { author: "Chiara", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2025-05-12", text: "We have been there with a group of 7 friends and it was one of the most exciting activities of our Japan trip. It was fun, well organized and in a very nice ambiance. We learned in a short amount of time where to cut fish, how to cut it, how to do different sorts of sushi and miso soup." },
                { author: "Gloria", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2024-06-05", text: "Whole family loved it! Friendly and informative instructors." },
                { author: "Peter", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 3, date: "2025-10-19", text: "The Instructor was not very engaged with the the group. I expected more interaction and hands on experience. The fish we got from the nearby market was great but did not justify the steep prize." },
                { author: "Joost", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2025-08-07", text: "Leuk om zelf sushi te maken. Snelle en toegankelijke workshop." },
                { author: "Traveller", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2025-08-06", text: "Very nice for family entertainment" },
                { author: "Hester", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2025-07-25", text: "Leuk dat het vis fileren en snijden op de markt ook onderdeel was van de belevenis. Wij hadden met zijn viertjes de workshop en onze gids deed het super! Mooie en leerzame en lekkere ervaring!" },
                { author: "Aude", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2025-05-11", text: "Super atelier sushis avec Junna : pédagogique, amusant et sympathique. Le lieu est facile à trouver à Kyoto. La communication a été fluide, Junna s’exprimant très bien en anglais. Nous étions en famille et tout le monde s’est régalé. On recommande vivement." },
                { author: "Jasper", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2025-04-29", text: "Heel leuk om eerst naar de markt te gaan en daar bij de visboer een verse zalm gefileerd te zien worden en de andere vis te kopen. Daarna gingen we in een authentiek Japans huis sushi maken. Onze kinderen vonden het ook helemaal geweldig." }
            ]
        },
